ng organisation regrouping the European pulp and paper industry and championing this industry’s achievements and the benefits of its products. Its mission is to promote the member’s business sector by taking specific actions notably, by monitoring and analyzing activities and initiatives in the areas of industry, environment, energy, forestry, recycling, fiscal policies and competitiveness in general.',NULL,'2025-10-21 12:51:39'),(1618,'Through its operating companies Smurfit Westrock is also a member of FEFCO (European Federation of Corrugated Board Manufacturers) which represents the interests of the European Corrugated Board Manufacturers. Headquartered in Brussels, FEFCO has 17 Association members, all European national corrugated packaging organisations. The role of the Federation is to investigate economic, financial, technical and policy issues of interest to the corrugated packaging Industry, to analyse all factors which may influence the industry, and to promote and develop its reputation.',NULL,'2025-10-21 12:51:39'),(1619,'Smurfit Westrock is also a member of 4evergreen which is a cross-industry alliance with the goal of optimizing fibre-based packaging circularity and climate performance. As the industry value chain, 4evergreen wants to contribute to a climate-neutral society by perfecting the circularity of its members products. Its aim is to raise the overall recycling rate of fibre-based packaging to 90% by 2030.',NULL,'2025-10-21 12:51:39'),(1620,'EuropaBio: https://www.europabio.org/',NULL,'2025-10-21 12:51:40'),(1621,'Precision Fermentation Alliance: https://www.pfalliance.org/',NULL,'2025-10-21 12:51:40'),(1622,'France Deeptech: https://www.francedeeptech.org/',NULL,'2025-10-21 12:51:40'),(1623,'Ferments du Futur: https://www.fermentsdufutur.eu/',NULL,'2025-10-21 12:51:40'),(1624,'Protéines France: http://www.proteinesfrance.fr/',NULL,'2025-10-21 12:51:40'),(1625,'La French Tech: https://lafrenchtech.gouv.fr/fr/',NULL,'2025-10-21 12:51:40'),(1626,