 22 million SMEs from 30 European countries. In this respect TURKONFED is a bridge between the Turkish business world and the European Union. In addition, TURKONFED has members from across the globe that gather under the platform TURKONFED International.  See TURKONFED: https://turkonfed.org/en/page/about-us',NULL,'2025-10-21 12:53:59'),(1885,'European Chocolate, Biscuit and Confectionery Association (CAOBISCO): www.caobisco.eu',NULL,'2025-10-21 12:54:04'),(1886,'Association of International Development Agencies - https://aidajerusalem.org/',NULL,'2025-10-21 12:54:06'),(1887,'Interaction - https://www.interaction.org/',NULL,'2025-10-21 12:54:06'),(1888,'Aluminium France',NULL,'2025-10-21 12:54:06'),(1889,'The Dutch Trade Association of Proprietary Traders (APT) represents proprietary trading firms who trade for their own account and risk are crucial for the proper functioning of the stock exchange, are supervised by the Dutch regulators AFM and DNB (https://www.aptraders.nl).',NULL,'2025-10-21 12:54:08'),(1890,'Holland FinTech is the Fintech Association for the Netherlands. Their mission is to connect people and organizations within the fintech industry, enabling consumers and businesses to benefit from innovation and development (https://www.hollandFintech.com).',NULL,'2025-10-21 12:54:08'),(1891,'The VEUO is a representative organisation of listed companies which looks after the interests of companies listed at Euronext Amsterdam. Their purpose is to contribute to a well-functioning capital market in which listed companies can flourish (https://www.veuo.nl)',NULL,'2025-10-21 12:54:08'),(1892,'Regeneron is corporate member of the Transform Alliance, the European Haemophilia Consortium and the European Federation of Allergy and Airways Diseases Patients\' Associations. Regeneron also supports the SPEAK UP for COPD coalition and is a member of the steering committee.',NULL,'2025-10-21 12:54:11'),(1893,'https://www.eu-asean.eu/',NULL,'2025-10-21 12:54:13'),(1894,'http