s contact for its Members with European governmental institutions as well as with other construction industry associations: architects, contractors, developers, etc. It also liaises with European construction materials sectorial organisations, the majority of which have joined Construction Products Europeas Associate Members.',NULL,'2025-10-21 13:12:38'),(4613,'Construction Products Europe monitors European legislative, administrative and economic measures affecting the construction materials and building products industry, and ensures, whenever possible, that the industry\'s interests are taken into account. To achieve this, Construction Products Europe strives to obtain from its Members consensual industry views on important pan-European issues.',NULL,'2025-10-21 13:12:38'),(4614,'PPA-Europe is member of \"Metals For Buildings\".',NULL,'2025-10-21 13:12:38'),(4615,'METALS FOR BUILDINGS is an alliance of European or International metal trade associations active in the building sector. It represents the interests of the metal industry towards European institutions and relevant stakeholders as far as the sustainability and recyclability credentials of metals in buildings are concerned.',NULL,'2025-10-21 13:12:38'),(4616,'The alliance was established in 2012 and became an ASBL in March 2013 under Belgian law.',NULL,'2025-10-21 13:12:38'),(4617,'www.phagro.de',NULL,'2025-10-21 13:12:38'),(4618,'www.m-r-n.com',NULL,'2025-10-21 13:12:38'),(4619,'www.world50.com',NULL,'2025-10-21 13:12:38'),(4620,'Plus many other local and national association and groups',NULL,'2025-10-21 13:12:38'),(4621,'UN Water: partner: http://www.unwater.org/about-unwater/partners/',NULL,'2025-10-21 13:12:39'),(4622,'Alliance for water stewardship https://a4ws.org/',NULL,'2025-10-21 13:12:39'),(4623,'World Water Quality Alliance https://communities.unep.org/display/WWQA/World+Water+Quality+Alliance',NULL,'2025-10-21 13:12:39'),(4624,'WASAG: https://www.fao.org/wasag/en/',NULL,'2025-10-21 13:12:39'),