 Alliance for Value in Health is a group of associations that represents a broad range of stakeholders including patients, scientific and professional societies, healthcare managers and professionals, hospitals, payers and industry. The Alliance together towards our shared vision for a Europe, where health systems are value-based, sustainable, and people-centred. By connecting different stakeholders, the mission is to facilitate health system transformation, share knowledge and best practices, and engage with policy makers and stakeholders at European, national, and regional level.',NULL,'2025-10-21 13:15:07'),(4956,'EURAHL - The European Coalition for Active and Healthy Living (EURAHL) is a group of   representing stakeholders active in the broader European Active and Healthy Living (AHL) arena. EURAHL’s mission is strengthening connections, promoting synergies, and bringing together the voices of European Networks working in the field of Active and Healthy Living.',NULL,'2025-10-21 13:15:07'),(4957,'Info: https://www.euregha.net/partnerships/',NULL,'2025-10-21 13:15:07'),(4958,'France Industrie','60974102057-03','2025-10-21 13:15:08'),(4959,'INSME',NULL,'2025-10-21 13:15:08'),(4960,'1. CA4SH - Coalition of Action for Soil Health (https://foodsystems.community/coalitions/coalition-of-action-4-soil-health-ca4sh-2/),',NULL,'2025-10-21 13:15:13'),(4961,'2. International 4p1000 Initiative (https://4p1000.org/?lang=en),',NULL,'2025-10-21 13:15:13'),(4962,'3. The PSM - Private Sector Mechanism (https://agrifood.net/private-sector-mechanism) to the CFS - Committee for the Food Security (https://www.fao.org/cfs/en/),',NULL,'2025-10-21 13:15:13'),(4963,'4. The National Network of Rural Areas Plus (PL: Krajowa Sieć Obszarów Wiejskich +) (https://www.ksowplus.pl/ & https://www.ksowplus.pl/baza-danych/partnerzy-ksow?tx_ksowpartners_kppl%5Baction%5D=show&tx_ksowpartners_kppl%5Bcontroller%5D=Partner&tx_ksowpartners_kppl%5Bpartner%5D=88&cHash=58125e722823f33de6950f2cb4b8d1c7).',N