ion, laws and regulations about infertility treatments in EU countries, patients safety and quality of care','2025-10-21 12:44:09'),(322610,'Sexual and reproductive health rights along with mental health are our area of interest on the EU level and since patient safety is an area of national competence, we focus on a collaborative approach and exchange of best practice action at European level','2025-10-21 12:44:09'),(322611,'Together with SEA Europe (Shipyards and Equipment manufacturers Association), FORUM OKRĘTOWE prepares input for the upcoming \'European Maritime Industrial Strategy\' in order to safeguard high-tech and strategic shipbuilding capabilities and skills for Poland and Europe','2025-10-21 12:44:10'),(322612,'We closely follow the developments of sustainability related files such as the Carbon Border Adjustment Mechanism the Fuel EU Maritime Directive the European Emission Trading Scheme for shipping','2025-10-21 12:44:10'),(322613,'Mostly related to activities important for financial sector ( FISMA , DG compétition DG structural reforms)','2025-10-21 12:44:11'),(322614,'- Reglamentos y normas relacionadas con la Política Agraria Comunitaria, con especial incidencia con los sectores de frutas y hortalizas, patata y flores y plantas','2025-10-21 12:44:11'),(322615,'- Reglamentos, normas y directrices de las instituciones comunitarias relacionadas con la política comercial en los sectores de frutas y hortalizas, patatas y flores y plantas','2025-10-21 12:44:11'),(322616,'EU digital single market strategy, European Green Deal, energy policy, EU foreign/neighbourhood policy, agri-food policy, defence policy','2025-10-21 12:44:12'),(322617,'ADIA follows EU legislative issues that may have an impact on institutional investors, for example, those that address aspects related to:','2025-10-21 12:44:13'),(322618,'-	investment products (AIFMD, UCITS)','2025-10-21 12:44:13'),(322619,'-	securities and capital markets (MiFID2, MiFIR, MAD, MAR)','2025-10-21 12:44: