gy EU Green Deal Nature Directives Water Framework Directive Nature Restoration legislation EU Action Plan for People, Nature and Economy EU strategy for Smart, Sustainable & Inclusive Growth EU Vision to 2050 Roadmap to a Resource Efficient Europe Green Infrastructure Strategy EU Youth Strategy 2019-2027 EU Solidarity Corp initiative Common Agricultural Policy (CAP) EU Cohesion Policy EU 2050 Climate Strategy European Territorial Cooperation (ETC) Invasive Alien Species regulation Coexistence between people and large carnivores (European Platform) LIFE regulation','2025-10-21 12:44:21'),(322631,'At international level EUROPARC is also working in close cooperation with the Council of Europe to ensure, at wider scale, coherence and consistency of policies relevant for protected areas across Europe','2025-10-21 12:44:21'),(322632,'We carry out advocacy and information campaigns on national and regional level in Western Balkans to transpose the EU legislation on alternative fuels, specifically EU AFIR Regulations and EV charging standards','2025-10-21 12:44:22'),(322633,'- Common Foreign and Security Policy and Defence (CFSP/CSDP)','2025-10-21 12:44:22'),(322634,'- European Defence Industrial Strategy (EDIS)','2025-10-21 12:44:22'),(322635,'- European Defence Investment Programme (EDIP)','2025-10-21 12:44:22'),(322636,'- Defence Omnibus Package','2025-10-21 12:44:22'),(322637,'- Defence Procurement Directive','2025-10-21 12:44:22'),(322638,'- Intra-Community Transfer Directive','2025-10-21 12:44:22'),(322639,'- European Defence Fund (including EDIDP/PADR)','2025-10-21 12:44:22'),(322640,'- Horizon Europe','2025-10-21 12:44:22'),(322641,'- European Space Policy (including IRIS² and European Space Programme)','2025-10-21 12:44:22'),(322642,'- Joint Procurement of Defence Equipment (EDIRPA, EDIP)','2025-10-21 12:44:22'),(322643,'- EU-NATO Cooperation','2025-10-21 12:44:22'),(322644,'- Border Management, and protection of critical infrastructures (CER directive)','2025-10-