omy will require a broad range of solutions to secure the future energy needs Green Hydrogen and synthetic fuels (RFNBOs) will be one of the key components of this transformation','2025-10-21 12:44:24'),(322667,'We are watching emission regulations for the continous monitoring of motor vehicles as well as the homolgations for light duty, heavy duty and NRMM','2025-10-21 12:44:25'),(322668,'Hydrogen and ammonia combustion measurement','2025-10-21 12:44:25'),(322669,'- Regulation (EU) 2019/788 on the European Citizens’ Initiative','2025-10-21 12:44:26'),(322670,'- Implementing Regulation (EU) 2019/1779','2025-10-21 12:44:26'),(322671,'- Commission Recommendation (EU) 2023/2836 on promoting the engagement and effective participation of citizens and civil society organisations in public policy-making processes (related to the European Citizens’ Panels)','2025-10-21 12:44:26'),(322672,'- 2025-2029 European Democracy Action Plan such as the Digital Services Act (DSA)','2025-10-21 12:44:26'),(322673,'- European Commission’s Better Regulation Agenda (COM(2021)219) and initiatives to strengthen participatory democracy under Article 11 TEU','2025-10-21 12:44:26'),(322674,'- The European Democracy Shield initiative announced by the Commission and embedded within the European Democracy Action Plan (COM(2020) 790) and Regulation (EU) 2024/900 on Transparency and Targeting of Political Advertising','2025-10-21 12:44:26'),(322675,'- Schutz und Handel von CITES-relevanten Amphibien und Reptilien (CITES = Convention on International Trade in Endangered Species of Wild Fauna and Flora = Übereinkommen über den internationalen Handel mit gefährdeten frei lebenden Tieren und Pflanzen),','2025-10-21 12:44:27'),(322676,'- Mitarbeit als „observer“ in diversen Arbeitsgruppen des CITES Animals Committee und Intersessional Working Groups','2025-10-21 12:44:27'),(322677,'- Teilnahme an den Vertragsstaatenkonferenzen CoPs','2025-10-21 12:44:27'),(322678,'- Erstellung von Materialien (z B Entwic