rategii leśnej UE Europejskiego Zielonego Ładu i roli przemysłu w oczyszczaniu i zazielenianiu UE przeglądu dyrektywy 2018/2001/UE w sprawie promowania stosowania energii ze źródeł odnawialnych planu działania UE \"W kierunku ambicji zerowego zanieczyszczenia powietrza, wody i gleby\" przeglądu celów w zakresie redukcji emisji w państwach członkowskich (rozporządzenie w sprawie wspólnego wysiłku redukcyjnego) zgodnie z planem celów klimatycznych na 2030 r opracowania norm emisji po Euro 6/VI dla samochodów osobowych, dostawczych, ciężarowych i autobusów unijnego celu klimatycznego na 2040 rok, zazieleniania flot korporacyjnych','2025-10-21 12:47:53'),(323919,'GreenLight Biosciences is interested in legislative proposals and policies related to agriculture, the environment, biodiversity, the sustainable use of pesticides, and crop protection regulation','2025-10-21 12:47:53'),(323920,'European Professional Card (EPC), Passaporto europeo dei Servizi, Direttiva europea qualifiche professionali','2025-10-21 12:47:54'),(323921,'V okviru krovne evropske organizacije BusinessEurope, katere član smo, se preko delovnih skupin (v katerih imamo možnost sodelovati) zavzemamo za podjetja – naše člane – glede vprašanj, ki najbolj vplivajo na njihovo uspešnost (trg dela, konkurenčnost, digitalni prehod, administrativne ovire…) Imamo svojega predstavnika v Evropskem ekonomsko socialnem odborom Preko obeh lahko sodelujemo z Evropskim parlamentom, Komisijo in Svetom, da zagotovimo, da se glas podjetij sliši pri oblikovanju politik EU Preko BusinessEurope kot priznani socialni partner lahko  sodelujemo v evropskem socialnem dialogu Naša glavna vloga je podajanje vsebinskih predlogov politik ter prispevanje k iskanju rešitev za izzive trga dela, s katerimi se soočajo podjetja in delavci','2025-10-21 12:47:55'),(323922,'International Partnership and Development Policy, NDICI, MFF, CERV, CSDDD','2025-10-21 12:47:56'),(323923,'Health policy ( rare diseases, health professionals, allied health professionals, clinical trials)','2025-10-21 12:47:56'),(323924,'Here are the specific activities:','2025-10-21 12:47:56'),(323925,'- HTA Health Technology Assessment and HTA Stakeholder Network Regulation EU2021/2282 of 15/12/2021: we are currently completing the form and preparing the information material to submit to be selected as part of the Network The call for application has been open on 12/12/2022','2025-10-21 12:47:56'),(323926,'- Clinical Trials Directive 2001/20/EC: We have adopted a joint position with the European Haemophilia Consortium (EHC) \" Clinical Trials : reducing bureaucracy in Clinical Trials: now is the time\"  We call for urgent actions to make clinical trials less bureaucratic and more patient centred, efficient and cheaper We are considering our participation in the Public Consultation on a multi-stakeholder plate-form to improve clinical trials in the EU launched by the EC and the Heads of Medicines Agencies on 03/02/2023','2025-10-21 12:47:56'),(323927,'- Blood Directive 2002/98/EC and Tissues and Cells Directive 2004/23/EC: we are acting to maximise patient access to effective gene and cells therapies by promoting the best possible structures to deliver the care in Europe We have adopted with EHC a Joint Statement on promoting hub and spoke model for the treatment of haemophilia and rare bleeding disorders using gene therapy This model is supported by the scientific and medical community and the patients organisations It has been published in the Haemophilia Journal It has been produced by our Gene Therapy Working Group chaired by Professor Wolfgang Miesbach','2025-10-21 12:47:56'),(323928,'- EU pharmacovigilance system: we have developed a pharmacovigilance program ( called EUHASS) to monitor the safety of treatments for people with inherited bleeding disorders in Europe Haemophilia treatment centres report adverse events directly to the EUHASS website and regular surveillance reports are produced','2025-10-21 12:47:56'),(323929,