etc NABU is also pushing for the implementation of existing EU legislation such as the EU Nature Restoration Regulation and the EU Birds and the Habitats Directives In general, NABU focuses on the conservation of nature Following the NABU motto “For humans and nature”, especially the implementation of EU environmental law, is a major topic for NABU and its groups Besides nature conservation, NABU also works on agriculture and fisheries, climate and energy, air quality, circular economy, and sustainable transport','2025-10-21 12:48:17'),(324018,'Digital Single Market, European Electronic Communications Code, Multiannual Financial Framework, Cybersecurity Act, ePrivacy Regulation, Revision of the Broadband Cost Reduction Directive / Gigabit Infrastructure Act, EU Relevant Market Recommendation, CEF2, Digital Services Act, Broadband State Aid, Broadband State Aid Guidelines, NGA and NDCM Access Recommendations, Fair Share / Sending Party Pays, Whitepaper on how to master Europe\'s digital infrastructure needs / \"DNA\", EU Taxonomy, CSRD','2025-10-21 12:48:19'),(324019,'Affari marittimi e pesca Agricoltura e sviluppo rurale Allargamento Commercio Concorrenza Consumatori Cooperazione internazionale e sviluppo Economia e società digitali Mercato unico Politica europea di vicinato Politica regionale Sicurezza alimentare','2025-10-21 12:48:22'),(324020,'Teilnahme an der öffentlichen Konsultation der Kommission zum EU-Aktionsplan für die Zukunft des Bio-Landbaus (gestartet im September 2020) und anderen zukünftigen Prozessen im Zusammenhang mit ökologischer und pflanzenbasierter Landwirtschaft auf europäischer Ebene','2025-10-21 12:48:23'),(324021,'Den fælles fiskeripolitik og dertilhørende politiker og rammer Primært med fokus på national lovgivning og implementering EU politikker med betydning for det skånsomme kystfiskeri, herunder EUs biodiversitetststrategi, havplansdirektivet, Havstrategidirektiv, Fuglebeskyttelsesdirektiv, habitatdirektivet og EUs ålegenopretningsplan','2025-10-21 12:48:24'),(324022,'Rail and navigation transport & transport infrastructures','2025-10-21 12:48:25'),(324023,'Raw materials and extractive industries','2025-10-21 12:48:25'),(324024,'Employment and social cohesion','2025-10-21 12:48:25'),(324025,'Justice and Internal Affairs','2025-10-21 12:48:25'),(324026,'Regional Development Policies','2025-10-21 12:48:25'),(324027,'Public Administration','2025-10-21 12:48:25'),(324028,'Agriculture and Rural Development','2025-10-21 12:48:25'),(324029,'Public Television and Media','2025-10-21 12:48:25'),(324030,'Creative Europe','2025-10-21 12:48:25'),(324031,'Defense','2025-10-21 12:48:25'),(324032,'Législations applicables aux professionnels de métiers d\'art','2025-10-21 12:48:25'),(324033,'Législations applicables aux très petites entreprises','2025-10-21 12:48:25'),(324034,'Législations relatives aux substances chimiques','2025-10-21 12:48:25'),(324035,'Législations relatives aux matériaux en contact avec les denrées alimentaires','2025-10-21 12:48:25'),(324036,'V oblasti legislativních návrhů se zapojujeme do debat v oblastech společné zahraniční a bezpečnostní politiky a vnitřního trhu v těch otázkách, kde jsou zahrnuty i zájmy našich členů Příkladem je Green Deal, nařízení REACH, problematika tranzitních licencí, Evropský obranný fond','2025-10-21 12:48:26'),(324037,'The relevant policy and regulatory areas cover a broad spectrum, including the Energy Union Strategy and the Internal Energy Market, the EU Emissions Trading System (ETS), External Energy Policy, and the 2030 Climate and Energy Framework Further key initiatives comprise the EU Infrastructure Package, the Regulation on Energy Market Integrity and Transparency (REMIT), the Markets in Financial Instruments Directive (MiFID), and the European Market Infrastructure Regulation (EMIR) Important environmental and product standards are addressed through the EcoDesign and Energy Labelling Framework, broader Environmental Policy measures, and the Clean Air Package The Digital Agenda for Europe underpins efforts towards digitalization, while dedicated legislation regulates Renewable Energy Sources, Energy Efficiency, Biofuels, and the Fuel Quality Directive Strategic initiatives also include the Heating and Cooling Strategy, policies on Energy Storage Development, and measures supporting Carbon Capture and Storage (CCS)','2025-10-21 12:48:27'),(324038,'In the area of energy markets, focus is given to the Electricity and Gas Market Design, including implementation through ACER, CEER, ENTSO-G, and ENTSO-E Network Codes Substantial financial support is provided via various EU Funding Mechanisms such as the European Structural and Investment Funds (ESIF), the Connecting Europe Facility (CEF), Projects of Common Interest (PCI), Horizon 2020, the EU Energy Programme for Recovery, the NER 300 programme, and the European Fund for Strategic Investments (EFSI) Additionally, the European Green Deal and its associated initiatives, the comprehensive Fit for 55 legislative package targeting the 2030 climate objectives, the Regulation on fluorinated greenhouse gases (F-Gas Regulation), and the Next Generation EU recovery instrument represent critical pillars for achieving Europe’s long-term energy, climate, and sustainability goals','2025-10-21 12:48:27'),(324039,'Main activities:','2025-10-21 12:48:31'),(324040,'European policy affecting the competitiveness of manufacturing in the sectors covered by the association','2025-10-21 12:48:31'),(324041,'Technical and regulatory affairs, standards, certification and harmonisation related to the following areas:','2025-10-21 12:48:31'),(324042,'-	Machinery Directive and Regulation','2025-10-21 12:48:31'),(324043,'-       Ecodesign Directive/Regulation and implementing acts','2025-10-21 12:48:31'),(324044,'-	Labelling (water and energy using products)','2025-10-21 12:48:31'),(324045,'-	REACH/RoHS  (Chemicals legislation)','2025-10-21 12:48:31'),(324046,'-	European machinery certification 