-10-21 12:48:37'),(324067,'EPIC has participated in consultations on emerging tech and privacy matters, including the EU-US Data Privacy Framework: report of the Commission on how the framework is functioning Virtual worlds (metaverses) - a vision for openness, safety, and respect and Artificial Intelligence - ethical and legal requirements','2025-10-21 12:48:38'),(324068,'GAHP works in Low and Middle incomes countries Our main work is to support a multi-stakholders process, owned by the recepient country, to prioritize the pollution agenda impacting health outcomes This work happens in LMICs, not at EU level Altough we follow all international and EU policies on health and environment As such as have an interest in \"Environment policy\" and REACH\" Altough we do not work to influence or impact EU policies We rather want to stay informed','2025-10-21 12:48:39'),(324069,'Development cooperation in the field of agriculture :  support to farmers\' organisations, both strengthening the organisations and giving support to their activities','2025-10-21 12:48:40'),(324070,'Política europea social y de empleo, política europea en el ámbito de la economía digital, política europea de I+D+I, política europea en materia de industria, pequeña y mediana empresa, medio ambiente, energía y cambio climático, política comercial y de inversión, política europea de mercado interior, asuntos económicos y monetarios, política fiscal, política europea de transportes y, todas aquellas iniciativas europeas susceptibles de impactar en la competitividad y desarrollo empresarial','2025-10-21 12:48:41'),(324071,'Implementation of the Food information regulation, trade agreements with Third Countries, animal welfare policies, additives, enzymes, Directive on the Unfair Trading Practices in the Food Supply Chain Microbiological criteria','2025-10-21 12:48:45'),(324072,'F2F Strategy Pigmeat - beef and poultry market situation Green Claims Biodiversity Strategy Green Deal and SFSs','2025-10-21 12