S, fossil CO2 emission reduction targets, legislation regarding the use of renewable energy, the Green Deal legislation, Packaging and Packaging Waste Regulation, Single-use plastic legislation, Producer responsibility schemes, etc','2025-10-21 12:51:39'),(324718,'We believe that European climate change policies should not be tightened in the absence of international agreements We therefore recommend that the EU gives greater priority to improving the overall competitive situation of industry in Europe towards which lowering energy prices forms an important step In general, we favour policies that promote the circular economy concept and stimulate the recovery of wastepaper Wastepaper or recovered paper as it is called in our industry is the basis raw material for our base product which is paper produced on the basis of recovered papers (fibres)','2025-10-21 12:51:39'),(324719,'Food Information to Consumers','2025-10-21 12:51:40'),(324720,'EU Framework for Sustainable Food Systems','2025-10-21 12:51:40'),(324721,'Proposal for a Directive on Green Claims','2025-10-21 12:51:40'),(324722,'Strategic Dialogue on the future of EU agriculture','2025-10-21 12:51:40'),(324723,'Novel Foods Regulation','2025-10-21 12:51:40'),(324724,'Common Organisation of Markets Regulation','2025-10-21 12:51:40'),(324725,'MiFIR, MiFID II, EMIR, Art 26(5), RTS 8, Derivative Trading Obligations, Equivalence, TOTV, SFTR, CSDR, IFR/IFD, DORA, CTP, transparency, T+1','2025-10-21 12:51:40'),(324726,'All relevant legislative initiatives affecting to the electricity industry and networks, in particular those related to the energy transition, Green deal, renewables, Smart-grids, Green mobility, storage, AMI, distribution automation, etc and any other connected with product policies and regulations, environmental policies, innovation policies, internal market, R&D, etc','2025-10-21 12:51:41'),(324727,'Normativa de ecodiseño, normativa de gases fluorados, normativa de ajuste de carbono en frontera, net