f the 2012 proposal for a Directive on improving the gender balance on corporate boards, which set the aim of a minimum of 40% of non-executive members of the under-represented sex on company boards','2025-10-21 12:55:03'),(325604,'-Promote the participation of women as voters and candidates in the 2024 European Parliament elections','2025-10-21 12:55:03'),(325605,'-Promote EU Platform of Diversity Charters in all sectors','2025-10-21 12:55:03'),(325606,'-Reach gender parity (50%) at all levels of Commission\'s management by the end of 2024 and increase efforts towards reaching a larger share of female managers in EU agencies','2025-10-21 12:55:03'),(325607,'AI Act  European Health Data Space proposal','2025-10-21 12:55:04'),(325608,'Fertilizing Products Regulation (2019/1009) Explosives Precursors Regulation, Ecodesign for sustainable products Regulation Green Claims Directive Mutual Recognition Regulation CLP-Regulation','2025-10-21 12:55:04'),(325609,'Participation at the regulatory harmonization between the European union (EU) and Ukraine in the pharmaceutical sector','2025-10-21 12:55:05'),(325610,'Regulation (EU) 2022/123 of the European parliament and of the council','2025-10-21 12:55:05'),(325611,'Regulation (EU) 2023/1322 of the European Parliament and of the Council of 27 June 2023 on the European Union Drugs Agency (EUDA) and repealing Regulation (EC) No 1920/2006','2025-10-21 12:55:05'),(325612,'Directive 2001/83/EC of the European parliament and of the council of 6 November 2001 on the community code relating to medicinal products for human use','2025-10-21 12:55:05'),(325613,'Formation of the European strategic stockpile (Critical list) substances and medicines aimed at minimizing the risks of shortages essential medicines on the European pharmaceutical market','2025-10-21 12:55:05'),(325614,'MER MEC is involved in committes for definition of railway standards (CENELEC, UNISIG, UNIFE)','2025-10-21 12:55:06'),(325615,'Diritto societario (pacchetto socie