 the European networks it is part of, monitored the legislative process regarding the Directive on Combating Violence Against Women and Domestic Violence (Directive (EU) 2024/1385), and initiatives such as the report on the situation of sexual and reproductive health and rights in the EU, in the frame of women’s health, the so called Matic Report (2020/2215) AIDOS participates in the formulation of policy recommendations for the implementation of instruments such as The EU Gender Equality Action Plan III (GAP III), to promote gender equality and women\'s empowerment in EU external action, and monitors closely processes such as the definition of each Multi Financial Framework','2025-10-21 12:57:35'),(326146,'AIDOS coordinates the Italian APPG (All Party Parliamentary Group) that is part of EPF, the European Parliamentary Forum, a network of Members of Parliament throughout Europe who are committed to protecting the sexual and reproductive rights (SRHR) of all people, both in Europe and overseas','2025-10-21 12:57:35'),(326147,'Moreover, AIDOS also regularly takes part in consultations, such as the recent ones on Gender Equality and LGBTQI+ strategies','2025-10-21 12:57:35'),(326148,'We plan to work and help the DG TAXUD, they are building a new European centralized agency for boarders and a data hub to treat all the different packages that go through it, and we would like to help them in the infrastructure/cloud side of it, by making sure that all data remains within the EU, working solely with a sovereign EU cloud provider','2025-10-21 12:57:35'),(326149,'Boligpolitik','2025-10-21 12:57:36'),(326150,'We are currently conducting world-leading research in diverse areas such as quantum nano, bio-nano, maritime technology, engineering, transport, water management, aerospace technology and robotics Therefore we follow the main legislative proposals in these policy areas, like the chips act, the data act, etc','2025-10-21 12:57:37'),(326151,'European Digital Innovation Hu