 bringing the communities on both banks of the Prut River closer together and establishing Moldovan–Romanian project partnerships, IDEP initiated 15 discussion forums that brought together over 1,800 leaders under the theme “Boosting the Absorption of European Funds by Moldova” (details here: http://bitly/IDEP-delegatii – agendas, photos, and press articles) As a result, numerous sectoral and inter-institutional partnerships were established between counterparts on both banks of the Prut','2025-10-21 12:59:13'),(326644,'Additionally, we wish to inform you that on June 4, 2025, we organized a debate in the European Parliament Following this debate, we approved together with the participants the text of a Call to Action, which was sent to the authorities of Romania, Moldova, and Ukraine, and also to the leadership of the European Commission and the European Parliament (http://bitly/forum15idep) We also launched a proposal to create a Trilateral Chamber of Commerce between Romania, Ukraine, and the Republic of Moldova (CCTRUM)','2025-10-21 12:59:13'),(326645,'GAP, EU-Regionalpolitik, Green Deal mit EU-Klimagesetz, EU-Restoration Law im Rahmen der deutschen Agrar-Verbändeplattform und dem Deutschen Naturschutzring e V (DNR e V) nehmen wir immer wieder mal online oder in Präsenz an Treffen zum Austausch über die EU-Agrarpolitik oder die Entwicklung ländlicher Räume teil 2017 hatten wir einen Europäischen Naturparke-Gipfel in Brüssel veranstaltet und Kommissionsmitglieder und EU-Parlamentarier eingeladen anlässlich einer europaweiten Studie zu Naturparken /https://wwwnaturparkede/naturparke/europahtml) Im Rahmen des EUROPÄISCHER TAG DER PARKE am 24 Mai 2024 - „DEINE STIMME FÜR DIE NATUR“ haben wir mit anderen europäsichen NGO´s eine Klima-Dekalaration verabschiedet, die europaweit die Aufgaben, Handlungsansätze und Ziele der Naturparke im Klimaschutz beleuchtet (https://wwwnaturparkede/naturparke-erleben/europaeischer-tag-der-parke-2024-mit-naturpark-wandertaghtml)','2025-10-21 12:59:14'),(326646,'Como compañía especializada en extractos botánicos y aceites omega-3 tenemos interés en propuestas legislativas o políticas de la UE que afecten a los sectores de:','2025-10-21 12:59:15'),(326647,'- Alimentos funcionales y complementos alimenticios (Directive 2002/46/EC on food supplements Regulation (EC) No 1924/2006 on nutrition and health claims made on foods)','2025-10-21 12:59:15'),(326648,'- Productos naturales y sostenibilidad','2025-10-21 12:59:15'),(326649,'- Bioeconomía circular (The EU Bioeconomy Strategy EU\'s Circular Economy Action Plan)','2025-10-21 12:59:15'),(326650,'- Regulación de novel foods y claims de salud (Regulation 2015/2283 Regulation (EC) 1924/2006)','2025-10-21 12:59:15'),(326651,'- Programas de financiación europeos tipo Horizon Europe','2025-10-21 12:59:15'),(326652,'Attendance of Council Working Party on Humanitarian Aid and Food Aid','2025-10-21 12:59:16'),(326653,'- Sovranità Fiscale dell\'UE','2025-10-21 12:59:16'),(326654,'- Scambio delle informazioni a livello fiscale','2025-10-21 12:59:16'),(326655,'- Il livello di imposizione fiscale minimo globale per i gruppi multinazionali di imprese e i gruppi nazionali su larga scala nell\'Unione','2025-10-21 12:59:16'),(326656,'- Framework for Income Taxation','2025-10-21 12:59:16'),(326657,'- Debt Equity Bias Reduction','2025-10-21 12:59:16'),(326658,'- Tassazione equa: prevenire l\'uso di società di comodo per l\'abuso fiscale','2025-10-21 12:59:16'),(326659,'- Sostenibilità e fisco','2025-10-21 12:59:17'),(326660,'- Aggiornamento delle norme antielusione alla luce dell\'evoluzione dell\'ordinamento giuridico comunitario','2025-10-21 12:59:17'),(326661,'Storage Strategy','2025-10-21 12:59:18'),(326662,'Nature Restauration Law','2025-10-21 12:59:18'),(326663,'Transport, Mobility Solutions, C-ITS, Connected and Automated Driving, Pollutant Emissions, CO2 Emissions, Road safety, Vision Zero, General Safety Regulation, Horizon Europe, Market surveillance, Trade, T