icy priorities:','2025-10-21 13:01:24'),(326936,'• High impact on the environment','2025-10-21 13:01:24'),(326937,'• Potential to make a difference on policy level','2025-10-21 13:01:24'),(326938,'• Achievable with reasonable effort','2025-10-21 13:01:24'),(326939,'• Strategic political opportunities and/or commitments','2025-10-21 13:01:24'),(326940,'• Public and media concern','2025-10-21 13:01:24'),(326941,'• Unique role, niche or gap','2025-10-21 13:01:24'),(326942,'• Potential to get funded','2025-10-21 13:01:24'),(326943,'• Expertise and support within the network and secretariat','2025-10-21 13:01:24'),(326944,'When deciding whether to set up thematic working groups, we consider all of the above as well as the interest of members to engage in a working group','2025-10-21 13:01:24'),(326945,'Where appropriate, the EEB will promote its objectives on a given topic by collaborating with, supporting and/or being advised by one or more of its member organisations which is/are active or specialized on that topic','2025-10-21 13:01:24'),(326946,'EU Biodiversity Strategy to 2030','2025-10-21 13:01:40'),(326947,'EU Common Agricultural Policy','2025-10-21 13:01:40'),(326948,'WATER:','2025-10-21 13:01:42'),(326949,'- European Water Resilience Strategy','2025-10-21 13:01:42'),(326950,'ENERGY:','2025-10-21 13:01:42'),(326951,'- European Grids Package','2025-10-21 13:01:42'),(326952,'ENVIRONMENT:','2025-10-21 13:01:42'),(326953,'-  ETS','2025-10-21 13:01:42'),(326954,'Körkortsdirektivet, Clean vehicle directive','2025-10-21 13:01:43'),(326955,'TomTom is currently following these legislative proposals/policies:','2025-10-21 13:01:44'),(326956,'- Type Approval and General Safety Regulation','2025-10-21 13:01:44'),(326957,'- EU Automated Driving - Implementing Act under Type Approval Regulation','2025-10-21 13:01:44'),(326958,'- Access to In-Vehicle Data (IVD) Regulation','2025-10-21 13:01:44'),(326959,'- Artificial Intelligence \"High-Risk Applications\" Regulation','2025-10-