eweiligen Abschluss Der Verband beteiligt sich außerdem an Konsultationen der Institutionen und der Agenturen Außerdem wird die Arbeit in technischen  Expertengruppen beobachtet, in welche auch immer wieder Mitarbeiter von Mitgliedsinstituten des Verbandes berufen werden','2025-10-21 13:04:09'),(327561,'EU energy and climate change policy','2025-10-21 13:04:11'),(327562,'EU circular economy and waste policy','2025-10-21 13:04:11'),(327563,'EU environmental policy','2025-10-21 13:04:11'),(327564,'EU policies related to transportation and logistics','2025-10-21 13:04:11'),(327565,'EU employment and social affairs policy','2025-10-21 13:04:11'),(327566,'EU chemicals policy','2025-10-21 13:04:11'),(327567,'EU sustainable finance','2025-10-21 13:04:11'),(327568,'European security policy, development of public safety, digitalisation and automobile policy, transport policy and increasing networking and interconnectivity of vehicles, European economic policy, internationalisation of European trade relations as well as agricultural and food policy','2025-10-21 13:04:12'),(327569,'Customs Policy','2025-10-21 13:04:14'),(327570,'Transportation Policy','2025-10-21 13:04:14'),(327571,'Postal Policy','2025-10-21 13:04:14'),(327572,'Competition Policy','2025-10-21 13:04:14'),(327573,'Security policy','2025-10-21 13:04:14'),(327574,'Labor','2025-10-21 13:04:14'),(327575,'Sustainability and Environmental Policy','2025-10-21 13:04:14'),(327576,'Data Privacy and Data Protection','2025-10-21 13:04:14'),(327577,'food additives re-evaluation, nutrient profiles, EFSA transparency initiatives, novel foods','2025-10-21 13:04:15'),(327578,'Kaikki EU:n aloitteet, politiikan alat ja lainsäädäntöehdotukset, joilla voi olla merkitystä yritysten ihmisoikeus- ja ilmastovaikutukseen tai verovastuullisuuteen','2025-10-21 13:04:16'),(327579,'Participation to the Group of experts on restructuring and insolvency law-','2025-10-21 13:04:17'),(327580,'The current task of the group is «to explore options 