egy','2025-10-21 13:05:43'),(327975,'Trade & Competitiveness Policy','2025-10-21 13:05:43'),(327976,'Automotive Action Plan','2025-10-21 13:05:43'),(327977,'Vehicle & Motorcycle Type Approval','2025-10-21 13:05:43'),(327978,'CO2 Emission Performance Standards for Cars & Vans','2025-10-21 13:05:43'),(327979,'End-of-Life Vehicle Regulation','2025-10-21 13:05:43'),(327980,'Internal Market and Industrial Strategy','2025-10-21 13:05:43'),(327981,'Data legislation','2025-10-21 13:05:44'),(327982,'Corporate Social Responsibility legislation','2025-10-21 13:05:44'),(327983,'UBA aims at targeting all Ukraine-related acts, starting from the Association Agreement and the necessary implementation regulations, to bilateral MFA agreements, that in any way concern national policies or practices concerning the functioning of the Ukrainian justice system','2025-10-21 13:05:45'),(327984,'- At the European Parliament, we are working on the EU\'s bilateral interparliamentary relations with the various institution','2025-10-21 13:05:45'),(327985,'1 Digital transformation','2025-10-21 13:05:45'),(327986,'We want to help implement policies to accelerate Europe\'s digital transformation, including:','2025-10-21 13:05:45'),(327987,'The Digital Services Act (DSA) and the Digital Markets Act (DMA), aimed at regulating major online platforms and promoting competition','2025-10-21 13:05:45'),(327988,'The Digital Europe Programme, funding projects in areas such as artificial intelligence, cyber security and digital skills','2025-10-21 13:05:45'),(327989,'2 Foreign and security policy','2025-10-21 13:05:45'),(327990,'On the European Union\'s international cooperation policies, in particular the European Parliament, we want to continue to play a role in the strategic direction of the European Union and our organisation:','2025-10-21 13:05:45'),(327991,'-Working with members from the Arabian Peninsula and the Mashreq countries','2025-10-21 13:05:45'),(327992,'- Contributing to discussions on military and humanitarian support for Ukraine','2025-10-21 13:05:45'),(327993,'- The ‘Global Gateway’ strategy','2025-10-21 13:05:45'),(327994,'3 Strengthening the rule of law','2025-10-21 13:05:45'),(327995,'We are working to ensure the EU\'s efforts to protect the rule of law in its Member States, in particular through :','2025-10-21 13:05:45'),(327996,'- The annual report on the rule of law, assessing the situation in each Member State and identifying areas for improvement','2025-10-21 13:05:45'),(327997,'- The conditionality mechanism, which allows EU funding to be suspended for countries that violate the principles of the rule of law','2025-10-21 13:05:45'),(327998,'- Regular dialogue with national governments, NGOs and other stakeholders to promote reforms','2025-10-21 13:05:45'),(327999,'4 Dialogue and cooperation with civil society','2025-10-21 13:05:45'),(328000,'We remain attentive to strengthening the dialogue between the European Union and civil society, in particular through :','2025-10-21 13:05:45'),(328001,'- Financial support for NGOs and civil society organisations, in particular through the ‘Citizens, Equality, Rights and Values’ programme','2025-10-21 13:05:45'),(328002,'- Public consultations on various policies, enabling citizens and civil society groups to contribute to the decision-making process','2025-10-21 13:05:45'),(328003,'- Partnership with international organisations to promote human rights and democracy worldwide','2025-10-21 13:05:45'),(328004,'Vårt arbete fokuserar på att bidra till en hållbar och konkurrenskraftig digital och industriell utveckling i Europa, med särskild tonvikt på frågor kopplade till innovation, forskning, digital infrastruktur, cybersäkerhet och hållbarhet','2025-10-21 13:05:46'),(328005,'Vi följer och engagerar oss i EU-lagstiftningsförslag och strategier som påverkar datacenterindustrin, digital infrastruktur och energioptimering Detta inkluderar initiativ som rör EU:s innovationspolitik, moln- och AI-utveckling, kvantteknologi, cirkulär ekonomi och cybersäkerhet','2025-10-21 13:05:46'),(328006,'Nedan specificeras de EU-initiativ och lagförslag vi främst bevakar och påverkar genom vår intressebevakning','2025-10-21 13:05:46'),(328007,'European Innovation Act [Q4 2025 – Q1 2026]','2025-10-21 13:05:46'),(328008,'• European Research Area Act [2026]','2025-10-21 13:05:46'),(328009,'• EU Cloud and AI Development Act [Q4 2025 – Q1 2026]','2025-10-21 13:05:46'),(328010,'• EU Quantum Strategy [Q2 2025] and a Quantum Act [Q4 2025]','2025-10-21 13:05:46'),(328011,'• Digital Networks Act [Q4 2025]','2025-10-21 13:05:46'),(328012,'• Industrial Decarbonisation Accelerator Act [Q4 2025]','2025-10-21 13:05:46'),(328013,'• Circular Economy Act [Q4 2026]','2025-10-21 13:05:46'),(328014,'•	EU Energy Efficiency Directive','2025-10-21 13:05:46'),(328015,'•	EU AI Act','2025-10-21 13:05:46'),(328016,'•	EU Cybersecurity','2025-10-21 13:05:46'),(328017,'•	Draghi report','2025-10-21 13:05:46'),(328018,'•	PFAS','2025-10-21 13:05:46'),(328019,'Hankintadirektiivi','2025-10-21 13:05:47'),(328020,'Gigabit Infrastructure Act, Gigabit Recommendation, Digital Markets Act, Digital Services Act, Data Governance Act','2025-10-21 13:05:47'),(328021,'AI Act, Apply AI Strategy, Cyber Resilience Act, CyberSecurity Act, Data Act, Data Governance Act, Data Union, Digital Fairness Act, Digital Markets Act, Digital Services Act, GDPR Review, Global Gateway, Public Procurement Directives, ICT Standardisation - EU Regulation 1025/2012, Union of Skills','2025-10-21 13:05:48'),(328022,'Vi beskæftiger os primært med danske, svenske og norske politikere og beslutningstagere i EU Vi beskæftiger os bredt med lovgivning og drøftelser indenfor teknologi, finans, energi og transport','2025-10-21 13:05:49'),(328023,'Kasvualustat, polttoaineet, ilmasto, ETS, RED, biodiversiteetti, ympäristö, vesi, vesipuitedirektiivi, aktiivihiili, sammal, komposti, lannoitteet, hiilensidonta, aurinko- ja tuulienergia, biostimulantit','2025-10-21 13:05:50'),(328024,'CLP, REACH, Additive re-evaluation & Enzyme legislation, Flavouring Substances Evaluation, Contaminants, Smoke Flavourings Primary Products, Sustainability, Labelling claims, Labelling regulations, Novel Foods, Nutrition, Taste, Additives legislation and evaluation, Pesticides, Food Safety, Innovation, Enzymes','2025-10-21 13:05:51'),(328025,'1 Harmonization of rules: Influencing efforts to standardize laws across member states, rather than dealing with a patchwork of national regulations','2025-10-21 13:05:52'),(328026,'2 Cross-border access: Advocating for policies that facilitate easier access for consumers and businesses to digital goods and services across the EU (eg, removing geo-blocking)','2025-10-21 13:05:52'),(328027,'3 E-commerce rules: Shaping revisions to e-commerce rules to ensure they are conducive to online business growth','2025-10-21 13:05:52'),(328028,'4 Standard-setting: Ensuring that technical standards are developed through industry-led processes rather than top-down Commission dictates, to avoid stifling innovation','2025-10-21 13:05:52'),(328029,'5 Public procurement: Influencing \"Buy European\" initiatives to ensure they don\'t unfairly disadvantage non-EU companies or limit access to the best technology','2025-10-21 13:05:52'),(328030,'6 Risk classification: Influencing how AI systems are categorized (eg, high-risk, limited risk) to ensure a balanced approach that promotes innovation while mitigating risks','2025-10-21 13:05:52'),(328031,'7 Compliance requirements: Shaping the obligations for high-risk AI systems, including data governance, documentation, human oversight, transparency, and conformity assessments','2025-10-21 13:05:52'),(328032,'8 General-purpose AI (GPAI) obligations: For developers of foundational AI models, influencing the additional requirements related to systemic risks','2025-10-21 13:05:52'),(328033,'9 Harmonized standards: Advocating for clear and practical standards to demonstrate compliance with 