-10-21 13:06:01'),(328134,'Floods Directive','2025-10-21 13:06:01'),(328135,'The Groundwater Directive','2025-10-21 13:06:01'),(328136,'Environmental Quality Standars Directive','2025-10-21 13:06:01'),(328137,'Fish Directive','2025-10-21 13:06:01'),(328138,'Regulation on invasive alien species','2025-10-21 13:06:01'),(328139,'Prawa podstawowe, rządy prawa, integralność wyborów, Digital Services Act, Transparency and Targeting of Political Advertising, AI Act','2025-10-21 13:06:02'),(328140,'Fondazione LILA Milano ONLUS, through its elected representative selected by LILA, is a member of the European HIV/AIDS, hepatitis and TB Civil Society Forum (CSF) In such role the organization, together with the other CSF members, is following developments related to the implementation of the policy framework on HIV and the other diseases for the next years, strongly needed to keep HIV/AIDS, hepatitis and TB on the political agenda of the Commission, and to make sure that such diseases keep being addressed even after the COVID-19 crisis which has threatened the capacity of European health systems','2025-10-21 13:06:03'),(328141,'In September 2019, the CSF and Think Tank were terminated by the European Commission It was decided to renew the Forum on a different basis and through new elections, in order to continue its advocacy activities for a comprehensive commitment taking into account an integrated approach in the response to HIV, Tuberculosis and viral Hepatitis and increased attention to the neighbouring countries Such integrated approach is intended to optimize financial and human resources and provide better and tailored health services to European citizens, with access to vulnerable groups','2025-10-21 13:06:03'),(328142,'In 2021 the CSF has actively taken part to the consultations leading to the political declaration that was submitted in June to the High Level Meeting on HIV LILA Milano took part to the consultations and it is taking part to all the online meetings and surveys to assess the impact of emerging health threats on HIV, hepatitis, STIs and TB, MPOX and more in general on European health systems LILA Milano is also active in the discussions around drug policies, being one of the two Italian Focal Points of the Correlation EHRN, and of health policies concerning TB, viral hepatitis and STIs, as part of the WHO Collaborating Committee on Tuberculosis, HIV and viral hepatitis prevention, care and support Since 2022, after the invasion of Ukraine by Russia, LILA Milano representatives took part to all Civil Society Forum meetings with the aim to give support to displaced Ukrainian citizens and to the meetings organized by the EC officials through the EU Health Policy Platform \"Supporting Ukraine, neighbouring EU Member States and Moldova\" In 2025, the attention of the CSF and other community networks is concentrated on the shrinking space allowed to civil society in the EU context, and to the drop of HIV and STI issues in the EU health agenda Strong advocacy is needed on the part of civil society','2025-10-21 13:06:03'),(328143,'ITI follows EU tax discussion and policy development including:','2025-10-21 13:06:03'),(328144,'VAT (including EU VAT portal, Mini one stop shop)','2025-10-21 13:06:03'),(328145,'Corporate taxes','2025-10-21 13:06:03'),(328146,'Financial Transactions Tax','2025-10-21 13:06:03'),(328147,'Compliance of Irish tax policy with EU law','2025-10-21 13:06:03'),(328148,'OECD Base Erosion and Profit Shifting project (EU input into)','2025-10-21 13:06:03'),(328149,'Tax transparency and information sharing (EU input into)','2025-10-21 13:06:03'),(328150,'European Taxpayer\'s Code','2025-10-21 13:06:03'),(328151,'EU tax identification number','2025-10-21 13:06:03'),(328152,'Excise duties subject to EU Directives','2025-10-21 13:06:03'),(328153,'Customs Duty','2025-10-21 13:06:03'),(328154,'Environmental aspects of taxation (EU input into)','2025-10-21 13:06:04'),(328155,'Anti-money laundering policy and direc