 Consumers Directive & Green Claims Directive','2025-10-21 13:07:19'),(328569,'Generally: Legislation and policy on energy markets, climate, emission reductions, renewable energy, hydrogen, energy infrastructure, definitions and certification of hydrogen, decarbonisation of industries and transport (esp aviation and maritime), technical product requirements, industrial emissions and permitting','2025-10-21 13:07:20'),(328570,'More concretely: Renewable Energy Directive, EU ETS, TEN-E regulation, Energy Efficiency Directive, ReFuelEU Aviation, FuelEU Maritime, Regulation on deployment of alternative fuels infrastructure (AFIR), Taxonomy, Energy Taxation Directive, Delegated Acts on Art 27 and Art 28 of the RED II, Net Zero Industry Act','2025-10-21 13:07:20'),(328571,'Horizon Europe, SET-Plan, Paquet Energie-Climat, C-ITS, Green Deal, FP10, European Hydrogen Strategy, European Plastics Strategy, Clean Industrial Deal, Renewable Energy Directive, NZIA, Critical Raw Materials Act, PPWR','2025-10-21 13:07:21'),(328572,'BBVA’s Brussels Office aims to share its experience and expertise with the European policy makers and contribute to economic recovery and prosperity In this context, our follow-up exercise covers EU regulatory initiatives in the field of financial services (Sustainable Finance - EC Sustainable Finance Strategy and the initiatives derived from the Strategy - Banking Union prudential requirements CRR/CRD, Capital Markets, retail banking, payments, structural reforms in the banking sector, etc), as well as other EU initiatives of interest for BBVA, for example in the area of Digital economy, Innovation and Technology, Corporate Governance and Company Law, Audit, Consumer Protection, Competition, Taxation, Corporate Social Responsibility, among others','2025-10-21 13:07:22'),(328573,'• Corporate Sustainability Reporting Directive (CSRD), Directive (EU) 2022/2464','2025-10-21 13:07:26'),(328574,'• Corporate Sustainability Due Diligence Directive (CSDDD) Directive (EU) 2024/1760','2025-10-21 13:07:26'),(328575,'• European Sustainability Reporting Standards (ESRS), Commission Delegated Regulation (EU) 2023/2772','2025-10-21 13:07:26'),(328576,'• Direttiva relativa ai meccanismi che gli Stati membri devono istituire per prevenire l\'uso del sistema finanziario a fini di riciclaggio o finanziamento del terrorismo, Directive (EU) 2024/1640','2025-10-21 13:07:26'),(328577,'• Regolamento relativo alla prevenzione dell\'uso del sistema finanziario a fini di riciclaggio o finanziamento del terrorismo, Regulation (EU) 2024/1624','2025-10-21 13:07:26'),(328578,'• Regolamento che istituisce l’Autorità per la lotta al riciclaggio e al finanziamento del terrorismo (AMLA), Regulation (EU) 2024/1620','2025-10-21 13:07:26'),(328579,'Textes découlant du Pacte Vert notamment :','2025-10-21 13:07:27'),(328580,'- Règlement relatif à l\'écoconception des produits et ses actes délégués,','2025-10-21 13:07:27'),(328581,'- Règlement visant à lutter contre la déforestation importée,','2025-10-21 13:07:27'),(328582,'- Révision de la directive cadre déchet,','2025-10-21 13:07:27'),(328583,'- Passeport digital de produit','2025-10-21 13:07:27'),(328584,'Directive relative au devoir de vigilance','2025-10-21 13:07:27'),(328585,'Directive relative à la publication d\'information en matière de durabilité','2025-10-21 13:07:27'),(328586,'Affichage environnemental','2025-10-21 13:07:27'),(328587,'Révision du Règlement REACH','2025-10-21 13:07:27'),(328588,'Règlementation relative aux PFAS','2025-10-21 13:07:27'),(328589,'Energiatehokkuusdirektiivi ja energiatehokkuuslaki, Energiatehokkuusdirektiivin mukainen selvitys hukkalämmön potentiaalista ja kustannustehokkuusanalyysi tehokkaasta lämmityksestä,','2025-10-21 13:07:27'),(328590,'reports on combating Antisemitism, racism and discrimination','2025-10-21 13:07:28'),(328591,'monitoring activities of the AFET Committee especially related to Israel','2025-10-21 13:07:28'),(328592,'Reports on the situation of fundamental rights in the EU','2025-10-21 13:07:28'),(328593,'Here are some examples of main EU legislative proposals or policies that IAF targets to foster peace in the Middle East, specifically between Jews and Palestinians, to stand up against anti-Semitism and discrimination, and speak up for the rights of persecuted Christians:','2025-10-21 13:07:28'),(328594,'EU-Middle East Peace Process: The EU has been actively engaged in the Middle East peace process for many years, working to promote a peaceful and just solution to the Israeli-Palestinian conflict IAF targets this policy to push for greater EU involvement in the peace process and to promote dialogue and cooperation between Jews and Palestinians','2025-10-21 13:07:28'),(328595,'EU Strategy on Combating Anti-Semitism and Fostering Jewish Life: This policy initiative aims to promote the protection of Jewish communities across Europe and globally and to combat all forms of anti-Semitism The IAF targets this policy to ensure that the EU is doing enough to address anti-Semitism and to push for stronger measures to combat discrimination and hate speech','2025-10-21 13:07:28'),(328596,'European Convention on Human Rights: The European Convention on Human Rights is a legally binding treaty that sets out fundamental rights and freedoms for all individuals in Europe, including the right to equality and non-discrimination The IAF targets this policy to ensure that these fundamental rights are respected and upheld in the Middle East and to push for greater accountability for human rights abuses','2025-10-21 13:07:28'),(328597,'EU Human Rights Policy: The EU has a broad human rights policy that includes provisions for the protection of freedom of religion and belief The IAF targets this policy to ensure that the EU is doing enough to protect the rights of persecuted Christians in the Middle East','2025-10-21 13:07:28'),(328598,'EU Guidelines on the Promotion and Protection of Freedom of Religion or Belief: These guidelines provide a framework for the EU\'s work on freedom of religion and belief, including actions to support and protect religious minorities The IAF targets these guidelines to push for greater EU action to protect persecuted Christians in the Middle East','2025-10-21 13:07:28'),(328599,'EU Emergency Trust Fund for Africa: This fund supports projects in Africa and the Middle East aimed at addressing the root causes of irregular migration and forced displacement The IAF targets this policy to ensure that funds are being directed to support persecuted Christians in the Middle East who have been forced to flee their homes due to violence and persecution','2025-10-21 13:07:28'),(328600,'EU External Action Service (EEAS): The EEAS is the EU\'s diplomatic service, responsible for implementing the EU\'s foreign and security policy The IAF targets EEAS policy to push for greater EU engagement with governments and other actors in the Middle East to promote religious freedom and to protect persecuted Christians','2025-10-21 13:07:28'),(328601,'EU policy fields of interest for ESGO include:','2025-10-21 13:07:29'),(328602,'·         Health,','2025-10-21 13:07:29'),(328603,'·         Public Health,','2025-10-21 13:07:29'),(328604,'·         Cancer,','2025-10-21 13:07:29'),(328605,'·         Chronic Diseases,','2025-10-21 13:07:29'),(328606,'·         Research and Innovation,','2025-10-21 13:07:29'),(328607,'·         Cross Border Healthcare,','2025-10-21 13:07:29'),(328608,'·         Health Technology Assessment,','2025-10-21 13:07:29'),(328609,'·         Data Protection,','2025-10-21 13:07:29'),(328610,'·         Clinical Trials,','2025-10-21 13:07:29'),(328611,'·         Digitalisation,','2025-10-21 13:07:29'),(328612,'·         General Pharmaceutical Legislation,','2025-10-21 13:07:29'),(328613,'·         Patients\' Rights,','2025-10-21 13:07:29'),(328614,'·         Healthcare workforce,','2025-10-21 13:07:29'),(328615,'·         EU programmes for health','2025-10-21 13:07:29'),(328616,'Транспортна политика на Европейския съюз','2025-10-21 13:07:30'),(328617,'Трудова и социална политика на Европейския съюз в сектор транспорт','2025-10-21 13:07:30'),(328618,'-	integrated PR and communication services for national and multinational companies from a large industries spectrum','2025-10-21 13:07:31'),(328619,'-	public affairs and professional consultancy for governmental and non-governmental institutions','2025-10-21 13:07:31'),(328620,'-	nation-wide education and communication strategies','2025-10-21 13:07:31'),(328621,'-	technical assistance for the management and development of online tools for the Representation of the European Commission in Romania and the European Parliament Information Office in Romania (activities: daily updates of the official webpage, developments of new features, management of online publications, organise events, provide staff and manage the European Public Space)','2025-10-21 13:07:31'),(328622,'-      communication for the new EU-funded program European Bank for Reconstruction and Development - committed to help small and medium-sized entrerprises (SMEs) obtain advice for sustainable growth -  organize the launch event (150 participants form the business and consultancy communities), media relations (press releases, radio, TV and written press interviews, subject pitching), digital communication (website construction and copywriting, launch of Facebook page and coordination of account, including advertising campaigns, newsletters) and events organization (trainings, business community dedicated events and workshops)','2025-10-21 13:07:31'),(328623,'-        Specialisms: Corporate communication Internal communication Crisis monitoring and prevention Financial communication Marketing PR support Online communication Institutional communication non-governmental issues Public awareness & education Urbanism and sustainable development Sports, Arts, Circular Economy, Environment protection','2025-10-21 13:07:31'),(328624,'* Avenir de l’UE: les propositions du Parlement pour modifier les traités','2025-10-21 13:07:31'),(328625,'Communiqué de presse SESSION PLÉNIÈRE  AFCO  22-11-2023 - 17:00','2025-10-21 13:07:31'),(328626,'Des changements pour donner davantage la parole aux citoyens et créer une Union européenne plus efficace','2025-10-21 13:07:31'),(328627,'Une adaptation du processus législatif aux enjeux actuels','2025-10-21 13:07:31'),(328628,'Des propositions concrètes pour tous les domaines d’action et une meilleure coopération dans les domaines clés','2025-10-21 13:07:31'),(328629,'Le Parlement attend du Conseil européen qu\'il appelle à une Convention pour la révision des traités en décembre','2025-10-21 13:07:31'),(328630,'Après la Conférence sur l’avenir de l’Europe et dans le contexte de crises et de défis sans précédent, les députés ont présenté des propositions pour changer l’UE','2025-10-21 13:07:31'),(328631,'En adoptant ce rapport, le Parlement répond aux attentes des citoyens pour une UE plus efficace et plus démocratique, conformément aux propositions de la Conférence sur l’avenir de l’Europe mais pas celle du monde où nous avons un rôle à jouer','2025-10-21 13:07:31'),(328632,'* Le Parlement européen a approuvé à une courte majorité la vaste réforme de la politique d\'immigration et d\'asile de l\'Union européenne','2025-10-21 13:07:31'),(328633,'Le nouveau pacte prévoit des règles collectives et prévisibles pour gérer l\'accueil et la relocalisation des demandeurs d\'asile, une question politiquement explosive qui a été une source récurrente de tension depuis la crise migratoire de 2015-2016, frustrant les tentatives continues de parvenir à une solution commune au niveau européen','2025-10-21 13:07:31'),(328634,'Marco de la Energia y cambio climático 2030 y archivos relacionados Horizonte 2020, impuestos ambientales legislación ambiental española Iniciativas I+D','2025-10-21 13:07:32'),(328635,'Politici: piața unică digitală pentru Europa, pactul verde european, eficientizarea sistemului judiciar, comerț și tehnologie','2025-10-21 13:07:33'),(328636,'Propunere de DIRECTIVĂ A PARLAMENTULUI EUROPEAN ȘI A CONSILIULUI privind combaterea corupției, de înlocuire a Deciziei-cadru 2003/568/JAI a Consiliului și a Convenției privind lupta împotriva corupției care implică funcționari ai Comunităților Europene sau funcționari ai statelor membre ale Uniunii Europene și de modificare a Directivei (UE) 2017/1371 a Parlamentului European și a Consiliului - 2023/0135 (COD)','2025-10-21 13:07:33'),(328637,'Propunere de REGULAMENT AL PARLAMENTULUI EUROPEAN ȘI AL CONSILIULUI de modificare a Regulamentului (UE) nr 910/2014 în ceea ce privește instituirea unui cadru pentru identitatea digitală europeană - 2021/0136(COD)','2025-10-21 13:07:33'),(328638,'Todo lo relacionado con cáncer infantil, enfermedad e infancia, protección de la infancia y protección a la familia','2025-10-21 13:07:34'),(328639,'Eurodad works for transformative yet specific changes to global and European policies, institutions, rules and structures to ensure a democratically controlled, environmentally sustainable financial and economic system that works to eradicate poverty and ensure human rights for all The network engages with EU initiatives to promote legislative action for tax justice, regulate vulture funds and end uncritical promotion of public private partnerships to finance social and economic infrastructure, as well as analysis of official development assistance and policy coherence for development','2025-10-21 13:07:35'),(328640,'Eurodad advocates for transparency rules for all large multinational companies through public country by country reporting, including on the Proposal for a DIRECTIVE OF THE EUROPEAN PARLIAMENT AND OF THE COUNCIL amending Directive 2013/34/EU as regards disclosure of income tax information by certain undertakings and branches Eurodad also carries out research and advocacy on preventing corporate tax avoidance, addressing the problems of the corporate tax system, and for strong whistle-blower protection and progressive taxation','2025-10-21 13:07:35'),(328641,'Eurodad is conducting research and advocacy activities on the implementation of the European External Investment plan as well as the next EU budget (2021-2027) , in particular the NDICI, which are currently under negotiation Eurodad is also monitoring the ongoing discussions in the EC and the Council on the European financial architecture for development','2025-10-21 13:07:35'),(328642,'The main institutions targeted by the Eurodad network are European governments, the European Parliament and the European Commission, the United Nations, the World Bank, International Monetary Fund and the Organisation for Economic Co-operation and Development','2025-10-21 13:07:35'),(328643,'•	Laws practice and Guidance on HIV Criminalisation and control','2025-10-21 13:07:36'),(328644,'•	Legislative Frameworks and Access to Justice','2025-10-21 13:07:36'),(328645,'•	Health Policy','2025-10-21 13:07:36'),(328646,'•	Human rights','2025-10-21 13:07:37'),(328647,'•	Molecular Surveillance','2025-10-21 13:07:37'),(328648,'•	Migration','2025-10-21 13:07:37'),(328649,'Battery Regulation, Critical Raw Materials Act, EU Green Deal, Fit-For-55 Package, Circular Economy Action Plan','2025-10-21 13:07:37'),(328650,'Inversiones sostenibles e innovadoras Construcción sostenible Soluciones de habitabilidad Directrices sobre ayudas estatales de carácter regional (Incentivos Regionales) Programa Next Generation EU (PRTR - Plan de Recuperación, Transformación y Resiliencia) Marco legislativo del Pacto Verde Europeo Programas Europeos de gestión directa: Horizonte Europa programa LIFE Programa SMP Erasmus Fondo para la Innovación Fondos Estructurales (FEDER) Instrumentos Financieros','2025-10-21 13:07:38'),(328651,'Bilanzierungsrichtlinien, CSRD, CSDDD, ESRS, Taxonomie-Verordnung, Corporate Social Responsibility (Nachhaltigkeit), Langfristfinanzierung, Digitalisierung im Berei