iales et environnementales, de comptabilité CARE','2025-10-21 13:09:09'),(329066,'Les principales propositions législatives ou politiques de l\'UE ciblées sont les suivantes : la transition écologique, la transition numérique, le pacte écologique vert, le socle européen des droits sociaux, la Politique Agricole Commune','2025-10-21 13:09:09'),(329067,'La nature transversale des Communs et de l\'Economie Sociale et Solidaire fait que les interactions sont nombreuses : communs numériques, alimentation, tourisme, mobilité','2025-10-21 13:09:09'),(329068,'First general-purpose AI Code of Practice','2025-10-21 13:09:10'),(329069,'- EU-Indonesia CEPA','2025-10-21 13:09:11'),(329070,'Procedure 2016/0143/NLE: COM (2016) 266: Proposal for a COUNCIL DECISION on the Union position to be adopted in the Joint Committee established by the Framework Agreement on Comprehensive Partnership and Cooperation between the European Community and its Member States, of the one part, and the Republic of Indonesia, of the other part, on adopting the Joint Committee\'s rules of procedure, and setting up specialised working groups','2025-10-21 13:09:11'),(329071,'- Voice the concerns and interests of the business community in Indonesia','2025-10-21 13:09:11'),(329072,'- Consult & lobby with government on key issues related to doing business in Indonesia','2025-10-21 13:09:11'),(329073,'- EuroCham Indonesia provides inputs and recommendations on regulatory developments to improve government & business relations and conditions of doing business in Indonesia','2025-10-21 13:09:11'),(329074,'- Through policy advocacy, EuroCham Indonesia aims to improve market access for European business to Indonesian market','2025-10-21 13:09:11'),(329075,'- Provide regulatory related information and update to European business, the Delegation of European Union to Indonesia and Representatives of European Member States','2025-10-21 13:09:11'),(329076,'- EuroCham Indonesia maintains and strengthens strong relationship with the Delegation of European Union to Indonesia, Representatives of European Member States, the Bilateral / National Chambers of Commerce in Indonesia, EU-ASEAN Business Council, as well as other Business Groups, Chambers and Councils','2025-10-21 13:09:11'),(329077,'Aucune','2025-10-21 13:09:12'),(329078,'Alma Mater Studiorum - Università di Bologna contributes to implementing the European Commission political priorities for 2024- 2029 ERA policy','2025-10-21 13:09:12'),(329079,'Alma Mater Studiorum - Università di Bologna participated to discussions on the development and implementation of the following policies as member of some relevant European university associations and networks (id The Guild, European University Association -EUA, Coimbra Group Network)','2025-10-21 13:09:12'),(329080,'For what concerns the European Research & Innovation policies:','2025-10-21 13:09:13'),(329081,'- Model Grant Agreement’s Intellectual Property Provisions of the European Innovation Council under Horizon Europe','2025-10-21 13:09:13'),(329082,'- New European Innovation Agenda','2025-10-21 13:09:13'),(329083,'- Proposal for a regulation on the European Health Data Space (EHDS)','2025-10-21 13:09:13'),(329084,'- Accelerating Clinical Trials in the EU (ACT EU)','2025-10-21 13:09:13'),(329085,'- Next European Research & Innovation Framework Programmes (FP10)','2025-10-21 13:09:13'),(329086,'- R&I International collaboration, risk of foreign interference, research security,  responsible   internationalization','2025-10-21 13:09:13'),(329087,'- Responsible use of generative Artificial intelligence European strategy for Universities','2025-10-21 13:09:13'),(329088,'- Data Act','2025-10-21 13:09:13'),(329089,'- African Union - European Union Research and Innovation Agenda','2025-10-21 13:09:13'),(329090,'-Green and digital transitions','2025-10-21 13:09:13'),(329091,'For what concerns EU policies in Education and Training, and in cooperation for development:','2025-10-21 13:09:13'),(329092,'- Commission Communication on a European strategy for universities (2022)','2025-10-21 13:09:13'),(329093,'- Commission Communication on achieving the European Education Area by 2025','2025-10-21 13:09:13'),(329094,'- Digital Education Action Plan 2021-2027','2025-10-21 13:09:13'),(329095,'- New European skills agenda (2020)','2025-10-21 13:09:13'),(329096,'- Council Conclusions on European teachers and trainers for the future (2020)','2025-10-21 13:09:13'),(329097,'- Strategic plan 2020-2024 – International cooperation and development','2025-10-21 13:09:13'),(329098,'Handelspolitik, Wettbewerbspolitik, KMU-Politik, Verbraucherrecht, Jugendbeschäftigungsinitiative, Europa 2020, Bessere Rechtsetzung, REFIT, Digitaler Binnenmarkt, Binnenmarktstrategie, Transportpolitik, Eisenbahnpaket, Klimapolitik, Energiepolitik, Markenrecht, Datenschutz, Produktsicherheit, Lebensmittelpolitik, Marktüberwachungspaket, Urheberrecht, Industriepolitik, EFSI, Investitionsschutz, Kapitalmarktunion, Forschungspolitik, Bildungspolitik, Information der Verbraucher über Lebensmittel, Sicherheit von Produkten und Kennzeichnung, Ce-Markieurng, Einheitliches Europäisches Patent, EEN, EUSALP','2025-10-21 13:09:13'),(329099,'The association Vorarlberger:innen in Brüssel advocates for stronger engagement between Vorarlberg (Austria) and the European Union, with a particular focus on increasing the region’s political and institutional presence in Brussels Our interest representation activities primarily relate to policies that impact regional cooperation, political representation, and mobility within the EU','2025-10-21 13:09:14'),(329100,'We follow and engage in discussions pivoting around the following exemplary EU initiatives and policy areas:','2025-10-21 13:09:14'),(329101,'1 Regional Representation','2025-10-21 13:09:14'),(329102,'2 Mobility and Labour Policy for Expatriates and Regional Workers','2025-10-21 13:09:14'),(329103,'3 Cultural and Political Engagement in the EU','2025-10-21 13:09:14'),(329104,'Advocacy efforts focus on ensuring that Vorarlberg is better represented in EU political processes, particularly by encouraging the regional government to increase its engagement with Brussels-based institutions, establish a dedicated representation to the EU, and actively participate in relevant EU policymaking discussions','2025-10-21 13:09:14'),(329105,'Secure Connectivity Programme, EU Space Policy, EU Spectrum Policy','2025-10-21 13:09:15'),(329106,'We are focused on working on the Drones Strategy, EU Strategy for a Sustainable and Smart Mobility, General Mobility policy, General Aviation policy, General Sustainability policy, and the European Green Deal','2025-10-21 13:09:16'),(329107,'PCEP has made several ambitious voluntary commitments aligned to the European Plastics Strategy including to: reuse or recycle 60% of collected polyolefin packaging by 2030 Ensure more than 75% of polyolefin packaging is designed for recycling by 2030 and improve the collection and sorting system','2025-10-21 13:09:17'),(329108,'Polyolefins are highly versatile and valuable materials used across a wide variety of sectors As a result PCEP follows all EU initiatives, policies and legislation relevant to our mission to transform the polyolefin system to a circular economy For example, European Plastics Strategy, Circular Plastics Alliance, EU Green Deal, Circular Economy Action Plan, Green Claims, End of life vehicles Directive, Packaging & Packaging Waste Regulation, Waste Shipment, Regulation on Food Contact Materials','2025-10-21 13:09:17'),(329109,'Denominaciones de origen y protección de actividades artísticas singulares, y los productos resultantes de las mismas','2025-10-21 13:09:17'),(329110,'zum Beispiel: KMU-Strategie, Industriestrategie der EU, Net Zero Industry Act EU Green Deal und Themen Nachhaltigkeit, Digitalisierung und Resilienz, wie CBAM, CSR, Lieferketten-Sorgfaltspflichtengesetz, CSRD, Sustainable Finance/Taxonomie DSGVO Energie und Erneuerbare Energien, insb Wasserstoffmarkthochlauf','2025-10-21 13:09:18'),(329111,'Die Hochschule für öffentliche Verwaltung Kehl ist eine öffentliche höhere Bildungseinrichtung des Landes Baden-Württemberg Sie ist politisch neutral Sie hat im allgemeinen ein Interesse an einer Stärkung der liberalen Demokratie, der Umsetzung von Menschenrechtsstandards und der Rechtsstaatlichkeit Als Hochschule eines deutschen Bundeslandes, die hauptsächlich für Kommunen ausbildet, ist sie an Vertretungen der unteren Verwaltungsebene auf EU-Ebene interessiert In den Politikfeldern der EU hat sie Interesse an einer hochschul- und wissenschaftsfreundlichen Politik sowie aufgrund ihrer Grenzlage und Internationalisierungsstrategie an einer Stärkung der grenzüberschreitenden Zusammenarbeit innerhalb Europas, der weltweiten Hochschul- und Wissenschaftszusammenarbeit und des Hochschulaustauschs, insbesondere mit Afrika sowie der Entwicklungszusammenarbeit','2025-10-21 13:09:19'),(329112,'Die Hochschule Kehl beobachtet mit dem Ziel der Integration in Lehre und Projektarbeit systematisch legislative und strategische Entwicklungen mit Bezug auf die EU als Ganze und ihre Institutionen sowie in zahlreichen Politikfeldern der EU, insbesondere die Globale EU-Strategie („Global Strategy for the EU’s Foreign and Security Policy“), die EU-Afrika-Strategie, das Programm „NDICI – Global Europe“ (Instrument für Nachbarschaft, Entwicklungszusammenarbeit und internationale Zusammenarbeit) und die Bereiche Digitalisierung im öffentlichen Sektor, Good Governance, Rule of Law und Klimapolitik im Kontext internationaler Partnerschaften','2025-10-21 13:09:19'),(329113,'Als Drittmittelempfängerin der Europäischen Union in Hochschulaustauschprogrammen (ERASMUS) und in Projekten der Verwaltungs- und Entwicklungszusammenarbeit (INTERREG, TAIEX, Twinning) hat die Hochschule ein Interesse am Ausbau und der leichten Zugänglichkeit dieser Programme Ohne bestimmte Legislativakte anzuvisieren, wirkt die Hochschule hierauf hin','2025-10-21 13:09:19'),(329114,'MINEX LLC targets EU policies and legislative frameworks that support sustainable food systems, industrial modernization, and regional economic integration Specifically, we follow and align our operations with the following key EU legislative proposals and policy areas:','2025-10-21 13:09:20'),(329115,'Farm to Fork Strategy under the European Green Deal – to ensure sustainable food production, reduce environmental impact, and promote healthier food options','2025-10-21 13:09:20'),(329116,'EU Circular Economy Action Plan – particularly measures related to reducing food waste, increasing energy efficiency in manufacturing, and promoting sustainable packaging','2025-10-21 13:09:20'),(329117,'Single Market Programme – for strengthening competitiveness and access to the EU market for high-quality, compliant food products','2025-10-21 13:09:20'),(329118,'EU Industrial Strategy – to modernize our production through digital transformation, innovation, and increased resilience in the food supply chain','2025-10-21 13:09:20'),(329119,'EU Western Balkans Strategy and Economic and Investment Plan – supporting regional integration, cross-border trade, and access to EU funding instruments to foster growth and competitiveness','2025-10-21 13:09:20'),(329120,'The execution and implementation of the European Green Deal and Taxonomy','2025-10-21 13:09:20'),(329121,'Work relating to free, open and fair democracies (eg European Media Freedom Act)','2025-10-21 13:09:21'),(329122,'Work relating to mental health (eg EU Mental Health Strategy)','2025-10-21 13:09:21'),(329123,'- Affari esteri con particolare interesse al settore del Peacebuilding e della risoluzione dei conflitti','2025-10-21 13:09:22'),(329124,'- Diritti umani con particolare interesse ai diritti dei giovani e delle donne','2025-10-21 13:09:22'),(329125,'- Cooperazione allo sviluppo','2025-10-21 13:09:22'),(329126,'- Cambiamento climatico e la correlazione tra cambiamento climati