 proposal focuses on the development of an advanced digital translator that converts spoken or written language into sign language in real-time, facilitating communication for individuals with hearing impairments The project aims to create a versatile tool that can be used both locally and globally, across various digital platforms such as mobile apps, websites, and virtual environments By enhancing accessibility and inclusion, this initiative aligns with the EU\'s social goals of promoting equal opportunities and participation for people with disabilities The solution supports education, employment, and social integration, while fostering a more inclusive society in line with EU values on human rights and social equality','2025-10-21 13:12:24'),(329852,'Our organization is strongly aligned with several EU initiatives including:','2025-10-21 13:12:25'),(329853,'- EU Accession support','2025-10-21 13:12:25'),(329854,'- Civil society funding','2025-10-21 13:12:25'),(329855,'- Security and democratic governance','2025-10-21 13:12:25'),(329856,'- Youth and leadership development','2025-10-21 13:12:25'),(329857,'Elpen follows all European Public Health Policy Developments Our priority is currently the review of the general pharmaceutical legislation','2025-10-21 13:12:26'),(329858,'CCS/ CCU - industrial carbon management','2025-10-21 13:12:26'),(329859,'EU:s utsläppshandel ETS','2025-10-21 13:12:26'),(329860,'Industripolitik','2025-10-21 13:12:26'),(329861,'Råmaterialstrategin','2025-10-21 13:12:26'),(329862,'Energipolitik','2025-10-21 13:12:26'),(329863,'Industrial Decarbonisation Accelerator Act','2025-10-21 13:12:26'),(329864,'ISME objectives include the protection and advancement of the interests of Irish SMEs  at all levels within the EU Institutions We engage directly or indirectly (via SMEUnited) with the EU institutions on issues of relevance to small and medium enterprise in  in Ireland, including:','2025-10-21 13:12:27'),(329865,'Economic affairs financial affa