, Family Reunification Directive and EU integration initiatives Our focus is on dependants\' access to employment','2025-10-21 13:13:29'),(330129,'- Insurance prudential regulation (Solvency II Review)','2025-10-21 13:13:30'),(330130,'- Insurance Recovery and Resolution Directive','2025-10-21 13:13:30'),(330131,'- Insurance conduct and distribution regulation (Insurance Distribution Directive)','2025-10-21 13:13:30'),(330132,'- Sustainability regulation, ESG Reporting (Corporate Sustainability Reporting Directive, Taxonomy Directive, Corporate Sustainability Due Diligence Directive)','2025-10-21 13:13:30'),(330133,'- Digital Operational Resilience Act, Artificial Intelligence Act, Artificial Intelligence Liability Directive, Financial Data Access Regulation, EU Data Act','2025-10-21 13:13:30'),(330134,'- Blue Growth','2025-10-21 13:13:30'),(330135,'- International Ocean Governance','2025-10-21 13:13:30'),(330136,'- Marine Knowledge','2025-10-21 13:13:30'),(330137,'- Atlantic Action Plan','2025-10-21 13:13:30'),(330138,'- Maritime Spacial Planing','2025-10-21 13:13:30'),(330139,'- Maritime Security Strategy','2025-10-21 13:13:30'),(330140,'- Juncker Plan','2025-10-21 13:13:30'),(330141,'- European Maritime and Fisheries Fund','2025-10-21 13:13:30'),(330142,'- West Med Initiative','2025-10-21 13:13:30'),(330143,'We follow especially topics around energy and environment like the clean industrial deal, Ambient Air Quality Directives, ETS-Directive, EU Critical Raw Material Act, Corporate Sustainability Due Diligence Directive, New Industrial Emissions Directive','2025-10-21 13:13:32'),(330144,'and trade issues like Free Trade Agreements and customs','2025-10-21 13:13:32'),(330145,'Citizens’ Climate Europe is focussed on implementation of effective climate policy, the most important aspect of which is based on Carbon pricing policy called \"Carbon Fee and Dividend\" also known as \"Climate Income” It is described in the EU Citizens\' Initiative: \"The fast, fair and effe