mitments under the Paris Agreement','2025-10-21 13:13:34'),(330165,'2030 Climate Target Plan','2025-10-21 13:13:34'),(330166,'Public Consultations:','2025-10-21 13:13:34'),(330167,'EU Green Deal – Revision of the Energy Taxation Directive','2025-10-21 13:13:34'),(330168,'EU Green Deal (carbon border adjustment mechanism)','2025-10-21 13:13:34'),(330169,'Climate change – updating the EU emissions trading system (ETS)','2025-10-21 13:13:34'),(330170,'National emissions reduction targets (Effort Sharing Regulation) – review based on 2030 climate target plan','2025-10-21 13:13:34'),(330171,'Regulations impacting OTC derivatives and market and reference data: in particular – Markets in Financial Instruments Regulation/Directive  (MiFID II/MiFIR/MiFIR Review) European Market Infrastructure Regulation (EMIR)','2025-10-21 13:13:35'),(330172,'Horizon','2025-10-21 13:13:35'),(330173,'Sociale zaken','2025-10-21 13:13:35'),(330174,'Energie, milieu en klimaat','2025-10-21 13:13:35'),(330175,'Landbouw en platteland','2025-10-21 13:13:35'),(330176,'Regionaal beleid','2025-10-21 13:13:35'),(330177,'Werkgelegenheid','2025-10-21 13:13:35'),(330178,'Digitale agenda','2025-10-21 13:13:35'),(330179,'Consumentenzaken','2025-10-21 13:13:35'),(330180,'Onderwijs','2025-10-21 13:13:35'),(330181,'Europees semester','2025-10-21 13:13:35'),(330182,'Europees voorzitterschap van de raad','2025-10-21 13:13:35'),(330183,'Begroting','2025-10-21 13:13:35'),(330184,'Gezinsbeleid','2025-10-21 13:13:35'),(330185,'EU-financieringsinstrumenten','2025-10-21 13:13:35'),(330186,'Action mémorielle en faveur de madame Simone Veil ancienne présidente du Parlement Européen','2025-10-21 13:13:36'),(330187,'Débat d\'idées sur le thème \"Vision pour Strasbourg L\'européenne\"','2025-10-21 13:13:36'),(330188,'Policies concerning the safe management of hazardous medicinal products at work','2025-10-21 13:13:37'),(330189,'Policy developments concerning Environment, Health, Energy, Climate Change, Sustainability, Trade, Industrial Policy, Raw Materials','2025-10-21 13:13:38'),(330190,'Crédito al consumo, Protección al consumidor, Economía y finanzas, Protección de Datos Personales, Seguros y Reaseguros, Administradores de créditos, Compradores de créditos, etc','2025-10-21 13:13:38'),(330191,'We work with our partners and members in Europe to support people at risk of lung cancer, people with the disease, survivors and those in a caregiving capacity We work to raise awareness regarding the lack of funding and resources devoted to lung cancer, which impacts early detection through to treatment and supportive care A key focus of LuCE is to advocate for equal access to lung cancer diagnostics, treatment and care across all EU countries, so that people can have the best possible outcomes and quality of life Over the past number of years, LuCE has produced 9 reports on priority lung cancer community topics and presented these at events hosted by MEPs (either in person at the European Parliament in Brussels or virtually) Key points of the LuCE reports are to highlight the level of inequity and experiences affecting Europeans impacted by lung cancer either as an individual living with the disease and their families, people in a caregiving capacity and our lung cancer community as a whole We believe the findings from these reports are crucial to support and drive the lung cancer policy agenda by increasing advocacy capabilities, elevating the patient voice, and hosting multi-stakeholder events','2025-10-21 13:13:39'),(330192,'E-Privacy, New Deal for Consumers, AVMSD, Europe beats Cancer Plan, Green Deal, Digital Service Act, AI Act, Political Advertising, Digital Fairness Act','2025-10-21 13:13:40'),(330193,'revisione di Solvency II, AI Act, Strategia per gli investimenti al dettaglio, Accesso ai Dati Finanziari (FIDA) ,','2025-10-21 13:13:41'),(330194,'Unione dei Risparmi e degli Investimenti, legislazione Omnibus','2025-10-21 13:13:41'),(330195,'Request of having the emission allowances of former Cyprus Airways to its subsequent owner company','2025-10-21 13:13:41'),(330196,'Subject: Allocation of free emission allowances to CYPRUS AIRWAYS under the European Union Emissions Trading System (hereinafter referred to as the “EU ETS”)','2025-10-21 13:13:41'),(330197,'CYPRUS AIRWAYS, as the successor of the former Cyprus Airways, is entitled to claim the allocation of the free emission allowances that corresponded to the predecessor, and which should have been transferred or allocated to its successor We consider that the allocation of these rights at EU level was not conducted in a manner that reflects the specific circumstances of the establishment and operation of CYPRUS AIRWAYS','2025-10-21 13:13:41'),(330198,'In light of the above, our intend is to request the European Commission to assess succession and fair allocation of EU ETS','2025-10-21 13:13:41'),(330199,'Clean Industrial Deal, Innovation, Wettbewerbsfähigkeit, (Competitive Compass, Union of Skills), grüne und digitale Transformation, EU Start-up and Scale-up Strategy,','2025-10-21 13:13:42'),(330200,'SME Policy, Regional and Urban Policy, EU Funding Programmes','2025-10-21 13:13:42'),(330201,'EU Policies and legislative proposals for recycling and funding for recycling','2025-10-21 13:13:43'),(330202,'Traditional Novel Food Regulation, like Kava-Kava (Piper methysticum), Coca Leaf (Erythroxylum coca) - Regulation (EU) 2015/2283','2025-10-21 13:13:43'),(330203,'Psychomodulatory substances legislation - 2025/0093/CZ (Czechia)','2025-10-21 13:13:43'),(330204,'EFSA procedures','2025-10-21 13:13:43'),(330205,'EUDA procedures','2025-10-21 13:13:43'),(330206,'Cross-border trade regulation and international trade','2025-10-21 13:13:43'),(330207,'Sustainability and biodiversity in supply chains','2025-10-21 13:13:43'),(330208,'Interoperability regulatory sandboxes - Regulation (EU) 2024/903','2025-10-21 13:13:43'),(330209,'Harm Reduction','2025-10-21 13:13:43'),(330210,'Mobilita, veřejná doprava, železniční doprava, rozvoj sítě TEN-T, práva cestujících, energetická a environmentální politika (snižování emisí a energetická náročnost), liberalizace, jednotný evropský železniční trh, intreoperabilita, inovace, digitalizace,','2025-10-21 13:13:44'),(330211,'Based on KNŻ\'s established priorities, including youth employment, mental health, civic engagement, and sustainable development, the following EU legislative proposals and policies represent key areas for targeted advocacy:','2025-10-21 13:13:45'),(330212,'1 Youth Employment and Social Rights:','2025-10-21 13:13:45'),(330213,'Reinforced Youth Guarantee: This cornerstone of EU youth policy aims to ensure all young people under 30 receive a good quality offer of employment, continued education, an apprenticeship, or a traineeship within four months of becoming unemployed or leaving formal education KNŻ can actively monitor Malta\'s implementation of the Youth Guarantee, advocating for quality offers that provide fair remuneration and valuable skills development A key focus should be the EU\'s ongoing efforts to ban unpaid internships, a topic KNŻ has already highlighted in its national work Engaging with the European Parliament and Commission on the proposed directive for quality traineeships is a primary target','2025-10-21 13:13:45'),(330214,'European Pillar of Social Rights Action Plan: This plan outlines concrete actions to further implement the principles of the European Pillar of Social Rights KNŻ can focus on principles related to fair working conditions, social protection, and equal opportunities, ensuring these are translated into tangible benefits for young people in Malta','2025-10-21 13:13:45'),(330215,'2 Youth Participation and Civic Engagement:','2025-10-21 13:13:45'),(330216,'EU Youth Strategy 2019-2027: The strategy\'s core areas of \"Engage, Connect, Empower\" provide a broad framework for KNŻ\'s activities The council can align its national initiatives with the 11 European Youth Goals, particularly those focusing on \"Connecting EU with Youth,\" \"Youth Participation,\" and \"Information & Constructive Dialogue\"','2025-10-21 13:13:45'),(330217,'European Democracy Action Plan: This plan aims to empower citizens and build more resilient democracies across the EU KNŻ can contribute by promoting media literacy, fighting disinformation among young people, and advocating for more inclusive democratic processes that actively involve youth','2025-10-21 13:13:45'),(330218,'3 Education, Culture, and Digital Transition:','2025-10-21 13:13:45'),(330219,'European Education Area (EEA): KNŻ can engage with the development of the EEA, particularly in areas of automatic mutual recognition of qualifications, promoting learning mobility (through programs like Erasmus+), and ensuring inclusive and high-quality education for all The council can provide feedback on how these initiatives can be best tailored to the Maltese context','2025-10-21 13:13:45'),(330220,'Digital Services Act (DSA) and Digital Markets Act (DMA): As young people are avid users of digital platforms, KNŻ has a vested interest in ensuring their safety and rights online The council can monitor the implementation of the DSA and DMA, advocating for measures that protect young users from harmful content and unfair practices','2025-10-21 13:13:45'),(330221,'European Year of Skills (Legacy Actions): Building on the legacy of the 2023 European Year of Skills, KNŻ can continue to advocate for policies that equip young people with the green and digital skills needed for the future labor market','2025-10-21 13:13:45'),(330222,'4 Climate Action and Sustainable Development:','2025-10-21 13:13:45'),(330223,'European Green Deal: As evidenced by their \"take on COP 29,\" KNŻ is engaged with climate issues The council can focus on the \"just transition\" elements of the Green Deal, ensuring that the shift to a sustainable economy does not disproportionately affect young people, particularly in terms of employment and affordability','2025-10-21 13:13:45'),(330224,'EU Climate Law: This legally binding target for climate neutrality by 2050 provides a long-term framework for KNŻ\'s advocacy The council can push for ambitious national policies in line with this target and advocate for greater youth involvement in climate governance','2025-10-21 13:13:45'),(330225,'5 Health and Well-being:','2025-10-21 13:13:45'),(330226,'EU Mental Health Strategy: Recognizing the growing concern around youth mental health, KNŻ can engage with the implementation of the comprehensive EU Mental Health Strategy This includes advocating for accessible and affordable mental healthcare services for young people and promoting initiatives that address the mental health i','2025-10-21 13:13:45'),(330227,'The Secretariat of the Eastern Partnership Civil Society Forum is following the work of the Committee on Foreign Affairs (AFET), work related to the European Neighbourhood Policy and to the Eastern Partnership Furthermore, the Secretariat of the Eastern Partnership Civil Society Forum is also following activities of Euronest','2025-10-21 13:13:46'),(330228,'Beleidsgebieden die raken aan de inrichting, ordening en toezicht op financiële markten, zoals daar zijn Solvency II, IORP II, CMU, IRRD, CS-DDD, CSRD, Framework for Financial Data Access, AI, Digital Operational Resilience','2025-10-21 13:13:46'),(330229,'- Monitoring and providing information on European politics and legislations','2025-10-21 13:13:47'),(330230,'- Organisation of events and seminaries on European legislation, implicating the euro-deputies and advisors of the European Commission','2025-10-21 13:13:47'),(330231,'- Presentation of the position of important Italian enterprises on European legislative proposals','2025-10-21 13:13:47'),(330232,'- Assistance and participation to the parliamentary sessions ins Brussels as well as in Strasbourg','2025-10-21 13:13:47'),(330233,'Principal dossiers:','2025-10-21 13:13:47'),(330234,'- European Defence Strategy','2025-10-21 13:13:47'),(330235,'- New Antidumping Methodology','2025-10-21 13:13:47'),(330236,'- \"Clean Energy for all\" package','2025-10-21 13:13:47'),(330237,'Pressure Equipment Directive','2025-10-21 13:13:48'),(330238,'Simple Pressure Equipment Directive','2025-10-21 13:13:48'),(330239,'Seveso Directive','2025-10-21 13:13:48'),(330240,'and similar','2025-10-21 13:13:48'),(330241,'- EU Klimapolitik, und \"Fit for 55\" Paket','2025-10-21 13:13:48'),(330242,'- Kreislaufwirtschaft','2025-10-21 13:13:48'),(330243,'- Biodiversität- und Forststrategie','2025-10-21 13:13:48'),(330244,'- Industrie- und Standortpolitik','2025-10-21 13:13:48'),(330245,'- FLEGT und EUDR/EUTR','2025-10-21 13:13:48'),(330246,'- Erneuerbare Energien Richtlinie','2025-10-21 13:13:48'),(330247,'- und andere','2025-10-21 13:13:48'),(330248,'Online child protection measures (DSA etc) cybersecurity, mental health and wellbeing','2025-10-21 13:13:49'),(330249,'EUROPEAN CRITICAL RAW MATERIALS ACT','2025-10-21 13:13:50'),(330250,'DEFENCE & RESILIENCE','2025-10-21 13:13:50'),(330251,'SEMI CONDUCTORS','2025-10-21 13:13:50'),(330252,'EUDR and Omnibus legislation','2025-10-21 13:13:51'),(330253,'Directive (EU) 2024/1275 on the energy performance of buildings (Energy Performance of Buildings Directive, EPBD) and related secondary legislation & guidance documents','2025-10-21 13:13:52'),(330254,'Regulation (EU) 2023/1542 concerning batteries and waste batteries and related guidance documents','2025-10-21 13:13:52'),(330255,'Ecodesign requirements for heating appliances','2025-10-21 13:13:52'),(330256,'Regulation (EU) 2016/426 on appliances burning gaseous fuels (Gas Appliances Regulation)','2025-10-21 13:13:52'),(330257,'Upcoming EU \'Affordable Housing Action Plan\' and \'Heating & Cooling Action Plan\'','2025-10-21 13:13:52'),(330258,'Upcoming initiatives on EU State aid rules and affordable/social housing','2025-10-21 13:13:52'),(330259,'As emotion3D, a pioneer in imaging technologies for in-cabin human analysis, we hold a vested interest in Regulation (EC) No 78/2009, otherwise known as the Pedestrian Safety Regulation, for a multitude of reasons:','2025-10-21 13:13:53'),(330260,'Preventive Safety Measures: Our technology is designed to augment safety within automotive in-cabin environments Our primary objective is to implement early warning systems through analysing driver behaviours and promptly identifying potential hazards By potentially preventing accidents and alerting drivers to the presence of pedestrians or cyclists, our technology aligns with the broader objectives of the Pedestrian Safety Regulation','2025-10-21 13:13:53'),(330261,'Legislative Compliance: We are continuously seeking ways to ensure our technology not only adheres to current legislation but is also well-positioned for future regulatory developments If we can evidence that emotion3D\'s technology positively contributes to vehicular safety performance, we can demonstrate its value to manufacturers Hence, we see ourselves as active participants in the legislative discourse, working alongside other interest stakeholders and policy-makers to shape future standards, such as those outlined in Regulation (EC) No 78/2009','2025-10-21 13:13:53'),(330262,'Enhancement of Existing Safety Systems: Many modern vehicles feature advanced driver-assistance systems (ADAS) that already include safety measures such as pedestrian detection and automatic emergency braking Our technology can have complementary effects that amplify the capabilities of these systems, providing a nuanced understanding of the in-cabin environment and driver behaviours This could lead to quicker, more accurate vehicular responses to potential hazards, aligning with the safety objectives of the EU','2025-10-21 13:13:53'),(330263,'Anticipatory Strategy for Regulatory Evolution: The current focus of the Pedestrian Safety Regulation is primarily on the physical design of vehicles However, we foresee an extension of the regulation\'s scope to incorporate in-cabin monitoring systems like ours We actively engage in dialogues with policy makers, industry partners, and stakeholders to discuss the potential evolution of the regulatory landscape','2025-10-21 13:13:53'),(330264,'Our understanding and active participation in discussions around this regulation help us align our technological offerings with safety objectives, regulatory compliance, and the strategic goals of automotive manufacturers and EU road safety authorities In this process, we strive to keep track of, engage in and possibly influence policy-making to highlight the benefits of advanced in-cabin monitoring systems for road safety','2025-10-21 13:13:53'),(330265,'Market analysis','2025-10-21 13:13:53'),(330266,'Merger & acquisitions','2025-10-21 13:13:53'),(330267,'Developement of models for market analysis','2025-10-21 13:13:53'),(330268,'Directives implementations in national markets','2025-10-21 13:13:53'),(330269,'Impact assessment of policy proposals on Member States\' markets (ie Eu digital Package, AVMS Directive, Copyright, EMFA, DSA, DMA, Fair Contribution consultation, etc)','2025-10-21 13:13:53'),(330270,'EU Digital Package, Gigabit Society, AI Act','2025-10-21 13:13:53'),(330271,'- MV BER','2025-10-21 13:13:54'),(330272,'- MV TAR','2025-10-21 13:13:54'),(330273,'- Sector specific legislation for the automotive sector','2025-10-21 13:13:54'),(330274,'- Rijbewijsrichtlijn','2025-10-21 13:13:54'),(330275,'- Mobility package','2025-10-21 13:13:54'),(330276,'- Road safety package','2025-10-21 13:13:54'),(330277,'- AFIR','2025-10-21 13:13:54'),(330278,'- New Heavy-Duty Vehicle Emissions','2025-10-21 13:13:54'),(330279,'- Euro 7','2025-10-21 13:13:54'),(330280,'- Vehicle Repair and Maintenance Services: Wireless Connection','2025-10-21 13:13:54'),(330281,'- Vehicle On-Board Diagnostic (OBD): Technical Progress','2025-10-21 13:13:54'),(330282,'- Roadworthiness Package: Revision','2025-10-21 13:13:54'),(330283,'- Energy Performance of Buildings: Revision','2025-10-21 13:13:54'),(330284,'Sustainable Finance taxonomy','2025-10-21 13:13:55'),(330285,'Green Claims initiative','2025-10-21 13:13:55'),(330286,'Capital Requirements Directive/Regulation','2025-10-21 13:13:55'),(330287,'European Single Access Point','2025-10-21 13:13:55'),(330288,'Climate-related benchmarks','2025-10-21 13:13:55'),(330289,'EU Ecolabel for financial products','2025-10-21 13:13:55'),(330290,'Retail Investment Strategy/MiFID II/PRIIPs','2025-10-21 13:13:55'),(330291,'Better Regulation/Impact Assessments','2025-10-21 13:13:55'),(330292,'Macro-economic policy','2025-10-21 13:13:55'),(330293,'Anti-Money Laundering framework','2025-10-21 13:13:55'),(330294,'- EU Strategy on victims’ rights (2020-2025)','2025-10-21 13:13:57'),(330295,'- Directive 2012/29/EU of the European Parliament and of the Council of 25 October 2012 establishing minimum standards on the rights, support and protection of victims of crime, and replacing Council Framework Decision 2001/220/JHA','2025-10-21 13:13:57'),(330296,'- COM(2021) 110 final: COMMUNICATION FROM THE COMMISSION TO THE EUROPEAN PARLIAMENT AND THE COUNCIL on the EU’s humanitarian action: new challenges, same principles','2025-10-21 13:13:57'),(330297,'- EP (2019/2819(RSP)), The importance of European remembrance for the future of Europe','2025-10-21 13:13:57'),(330298,'- DG NEAR: EU Enlargement Policy','2025-10-21 13:13:57'),(330299,'1 The Green Deal Industrial Plan','2025-10-21 13:13:57'),(330300,'2 EU Taxonomy','2025-10-21 13:13:57'),(330301,'3 CSRD','2025-10-21 13:13:57'),(330302,'4 CSDDD','2025-10-21 13:13:57'),(330303,'5 Omnibus','2025-10-21 13:13:57'),(330304,'We target the focus upon improving outcomes in young people with cancer We are also interested in the European Clinical Trial legislation and ongoing research and structural initiatives, including the Beating Cancer Plan','2025-10-21 13:13:58'),(330305,'Regulation (EU) N° 165/2014','2025-10-21 13:13:59'),(330306,'All EU initiatives, policies and legislative files touching upon plant breeding (including access to genetic resources, research and development), seed production, seed trade and seed marketing','2025-10-21 13:14:00'),(330307,'Current legislative proposals are (amongst others)','2025-10-21 13:14:00'),(330308,'- Draft Regulation on Novel genomic Techniques (NGTs)','2025-10-21 13:14:00'),(330309,'- Draft Regulation on Plant Reproductive Material (PRM)','2025-10-21 13:14:00'),(330310,'Backslash is setting up a pan‑European network of young advocates for democratic participation, building on the legacy and follow‑up actions of the European Year of Youth (2022) Our aim is to strengthen youth civic and electoral participation, improve young people’s access to EU decision‑making, and equip them with advocacy, communication and organisational skills so they can meaningfully contribute to EU policies that affect them','2025-10-21 13:14:01'),(330311,'To achieve these goals, we seek accredited access to the European Parliament and other EU institutions in order to:','2025-10-21 13:14:01'),(330312,'- Organise meetings and roundtables with MEPs, political groups, relevant committees and intergroups on youth participation, democratic resilience and civic space','2025-10-21 13:14:01'),(330313,'- Contribute to public consultations, hearings and rapporteur outreach on files that touch youth engagement, education for democracy, digital participation and electoral inclusion','2025-10-21 13:14:01'),(330314,'- Present evidence and youth‑led recommendations drawn from our transnational network to EU policymakers and services','2025-10-21 13:14:01'),(330315,'- Facilitate study visits and capacity‑building sessions in Brussels/Strasbourg for our young advocates, ensuring all interactions comply with the Interinstitutional Agreement on a mandatory Transparency Register (2021) and the Register’s Code of Conduct','2025-10-21 13:14:01'),(330316,'Policy areas / EU initiatives followed: youth policy and participation democratic resilience and civic space education for citizenship the follow‑up to the European Year of Youth 2022 and parliamentary work related to increasing youth turnout and representation Our activities specifically respond to the evidence on low and uneven youth participation in European democratic processes and aim to channel structured youth input into EU deliberations','2025-10-21 13:14:01'),(330317,'Pesi e dimensioni, tassazione energia, finanziamento delle reti transeuropee, nuovo progetto in sostituzione del Marco Polo sulle autostrade del mare, trasporti combinati, Accesso alla professione ed al mercato, Cabotaggio, livello sanzionatorio per cabotaggio illegale, tassazione delle infrastrutture e internalizzazione costi esterni, Salario minimo in Europa, servizi postali, ambiente, trasporti intelligenti (ITC), servizi consegna transfrontaliera pacchi, distacco transnazionale, IVA, codice doganale unionale, capacità ferroviaria, vie navigabili interni, ground handling, servizi aerei','2025-10-21 13:14:02'),(330318,'/ Digital Services Act and Digital Markets Act','2025-10-21 13:14:03'),(330319,'/ New Consumer Agenda (including General Product Safety Regulation)','2025-10-21 13:14:03'),(330320,'/ Vertical Block Exemption Regulation','2025-10-21 13:14:03'),(330321,'/ General Data Protection Regulation','2025-10-21 13:14:03'),(330322,'/ Consumer Credit Directive','2025-10-21 13:14:03'),(330323,'/ Online Fairness (fitness check, directive for financial services)','2025-10-21 13:14:03'),(330324,'/ Payment Services Regulation and PSD3','2025-10-21 13:14:03'),(330325,'/ Union Custom code Reform','2025-10-21 13:14:03'),(330326,'/ Other policy initiatives in the areas of: artificial intelligence, data privacy and data protection, as well as postal services','2025-10-21 13:14:03'),(330327,'Pecific legislative proposal targeted is 2023/0397(COD) Full procedure Establishing the Reform and Growth Facility for the Western Balkans and supplementing acts and all future legislations and procedures correlating with aforementioned policies','2025-10-21 13:14:05'),(330328,'The project directly contributes to and aligns with the objectives of key EU legislative and policy frameworks, including:','2025-10-21 13:14:05'),(330329,'European Green Deal – by promoting decarbonisation of transport through the introduction of an electric delivery fleet and rooftop photovoltaic systems, reducing GHG emissions by over 4,000 tons annually','2025-10-21 13:14:05'),(330330,'EU Circular Economy Action Plan – through the establishment of a secondary steel processing facility that recycles scrap metal and reduces dependency on raw materials','2025-10-21 13:14:05'),(330331,'EU Industrial Strategy – by strengthening regional value chains, modernising production capacities, and fostering resilience and competitiveness in the construction sector','2025-10-21 13:14:05'),(330332,'REPowerEU – by investing in renewable energy production (PV plant), improving energy efficiency and reducing reliance on imported energy sources','2025-10-21 13:14:05'),(330333,'Sustainable and Smart Mobility Strategy – via investment in e-mobility and route optimisation software to reduce environmental and fuel impact','2025-10-21 13:14:05'),(330334,'Western Balkans Green Agenda (aligned with EU Green Deal) – by supporting sustainable economic development, environmental protection, and energy transition in the region','2025-10-21 13:14:05'),(330335,'The project is also consistent with the EU Taxonomy Regulation and follows the Do No Significant Harm (DNSH) principle, ensuring that environmental and social safeguards are fully respected throughout implementation','2025-10-21 13:14:05'),(330336,'Banking','2025-10-21 13:14:05'),(330337,'Internal market and consumer protection','2025-10-21 13:14:05'),(330338,'Information Society','2025-10-21 13:14:05'),(330339,'Life sciences, Research & development','2025-10-21 13:14:05'),(330340,'Healthcare','2025-10-21 13:14:06'),(330341,'Ag