Pact on Asylum and Migration), integration policy (ie the Action Plan on Integration of Third Country Nationals), as well as humanitarian aid for those forcibly replaced, and social cohesion (ie combatting anti-Semitism and xenophobia)','2025-10-21 13:15:47'),(330810,'Pension issues: IORP directive, PEPP, Pension Tracking','2025-10-21 13:15:48'),(330811,'Financial regulation: EMIR, AIFMD, sustainable finance, CSDDD, SECR','2025-10-21 13:15:48'),(330812,'FIDA and Open Finance','2025-10-21 13:15:48'),(330813,'Long term investment and capital markets Union','2025-10-21 13:15:48'),(330814,'Supervision on financial markets','2025-10-21 13:15:48'),(330815,'Climate policies including CID, hydrogen and battery initiatives','2025-10-21 13:15:48'),(330816,'Economic Security, Defense and outbound investments','2025-10-21 13:15:48'),(330817,'Lokalisierungsvorschriften für Batterieproduktion in Europa','2025-10-21 13:15:49'),(330818,'Competitiveness, Entrepreneurship, Growth Initiatives, R&D, Innovation, SME policy, Internationalisation, Trade, FTAs, Digital Business, Travel, Tourism, Transport, Infrastructure, Investments','2025-10-21 13:15:50'),(330819,'We are actively involved in drug policy work, and we have contributed to the creation of public policies and strategies that lead to more effective programs in the fight against drug abuse We are active on global drug policy levels within the major umbrella organizations and networks such as EURAD, World Federation Against Drugs, Recovered Users Network (RUN),Vienna NGO Committee, IOGT, ECETT, European Commission as members of Civil Society Forum and we actively participate in all major world addiction conferences Our President is chair of Recover Users Network, which brings together all NGOs and individuals from around the world who advocate for prevention and full recovery from addiction Our President was a member of Civil Society Task force representing affected population of recovered users during the preparation process for the UNGASS and we are following closely the implementation of UNGASS outcome document We are members of working group for the new Drugs Strategy in Bosnia and Herzegovina and therefore following EU Drug Strategy and implementation as well as growing initiatives for legalization','2025-10-21 13:15:50'),(330820,'TÜV Rheinland verfolgt alle politischen Initiativen und Gesetzgebungsvorhaben hinsichtlich Sicherheit, Verbraucherschutz und Nachhaltigkeit Beispeilhaft seien genannt: Der Neue Ansatz (New Approach), Green Deal, CSRD, Cybersicherheit, Netzwerk und Informationssicherheits, Mobilitätspaket, Intelligente Verkehrssysteme, Waren-Paket, Freihandelsabkommen mit Drittländern, EU Binnenmarktstrategie, Kreislaufwirtschaft','2025-10-21 13:15:51'),(330821,'European Parliament resolution on organ harvesting in China (2013/2981(RSP)','2025-10-21 13:15:52'),(330822,'European Parliament written declaration submitted under Rule 136 of the Rules of Procedure','2025-10-21 13:15:52'),(330823,'on stopping organ harvesting from prisoners of conscience in China','2025-10-21 13:15:52'),(330824,'European Parliament resolution on on the reports of continued organ harvesting in China (2022/ 2657 (RSP)) - https://wwweuroparleuropaeu/doceo/document/TA-9-2022-0200_ENhtml','2025-10-21 13:15:52'),(330825,'In general: the continuous appeal of persecution of prisoners of conscience and the terrible human rights situation in China','2025-10-21 13:15:52'),(330826,'All files potentially impacting Air Transport including:','2025-10-21 13:15:53'),(330827,'- Refuel EU Aviation and associated delegated and implementing acts','2025-10-21 13:15:53'),(330828,'- EU Taxonomy Climate Delegated Act','2025-10-21 13:15:53'),(330829,'- Reporting of non-CO2 effects within ETS','2025-10-21 13:15:53'),(330830,'- Energy Taxation Directive (ETD)','2025-10-21 13:15:53'),(330831,'- Net Zero Industry Act (NZIA)','2025-10-21 13:15:53'),(330832,'- Revision of the Slots Regulation','2025-10-21 13:15:53'),(330833,'- the