ts initiatives eg European Cancer Information Systems & Inequalities Registry','2025-10-21 13:16:24'),(330975,'- EU Cancer Mission','2025-10-21 13:16:24'),(330976,'- Pharmaceutical Strategy for Europe','2025-10-21 13:16:24'),(330977,'- Critical Medicine Act','2025-10-21 13:16:24'),(330978,'- EU Lifesciences Strategy','2025-10-21 13:16:24'),(330979,'- Heath Technology Assessment','2025-10-21 13:16:25'),(330980,'- European Reference Networks','2025-10-21 13:16:25'),(330981,'- Multi-annual Financial Framework','2025-10-21 13:16:25'),(330982,'- Health Emergency Preparedness and Response','2025-10-21 13:16:25'),(330983,'Main EU legislative files followed as of October 2025:','2025-10-21 13:16:25'),(330984,'- Revision of the EU Pharmaceutical Legislation including as pertaining to Regulation and Directive on Medicinal products for human use, Regulation','2025-10-21 13:16:25'),(330985,'on medicinal products for paediatric use, Regulation on orphan medicinal products, Regulation on advanced therapy medicinal products','2025-10-21 13:16:25'),(330986,'- Critical Medicines Act','2025-10-21 13:16:25'),(330987,'- Biotech Act','2025-10-21 13:16:25'),(330988,'- Innovation Act','2025-10-21 13:16:25'),(330989,'- MFF','2025-10-21 13:16:25'),(330990,'- General Data Protection Regulation [implementation and evaluations]','2025-10-21 13:16:25'),(330991,'- Directive on patients’ rights in cross-border healthcare [implementation and evaluations]','2025-10-21 13:16:25'),(330992,'- Clinical Trial Regulation [implementation and evaluations]','2025-10-21 13:16:25'),(330993,'SIOPE also follows EU initiatives in other relevant areas such as Employment, Social Affairs and Inclusion [eg, European Pillar of Social Rights], International Partnerships [eg, EU Global Health Strategy], Justice and Fundamental rights [eg, EU Strategy on the Rights of the Child], Education, Youth, Sport and Culture [eg Erasmus+]','2025-10-21 13:16:25'),(330994,'The \"Università della Campania Luigi Vanvitelli\" follows various initiatives in many fields, like research (FP7 and H2020), education and knowledge (Erasmus+ and Life) and others funding schemes provided by EC','2025-10-21 13:16:26'),(330995,'Principaux dossiers suivis : Réforme de la PAC, Réglement OCM Unique et textes d’application du règlement OCM 1308/2013 , mise en œuvre du règlement INCO, promotion des produits agricoles, définition et normes de produits, agriculture biologique, taxation et circulation des produits soumis à accises, fonctionnement du marché intérieur, Développement durable…','2025-10-21 13:16:27'),(330996,'EiPA trade negotiations where we try and influence the negotiators to allow our products into the European market','2025-10-21 13:16:27'),(330997,'Influence the rules for allowing Papua New Guinea exports to enter the European Union Market','2025-10-21 13:16:27'),(330998,'EU relationship with Moldova','2025-10-21 13:16:31'),(330999,'Regional security, combating disinformation and hybrid threats','2025-10-21 13:16:31'),(331000,'Europa-Parlamentets og Rådets Direktiv 2013/11/EU','2025-10-21 13:16:32'),(331001,'Europa-Parlamentets og Rådets Forordning nr 524/2013','2025-10-21 13:16:32'),(331002,'1) Regulation to Prevent and Combat Child Sexual Abuse (CSAR, COM/2022/209)','2025-10-21 13:16:32'),(331003,'This flagship (and controversial) proposal would oblige hosting, messaging and other online services to assess CSA risks, take proportionate mitigation measures, and—subject to strict conditions—detect, report and remove CSAM and grooming, under the oversight of a new EU Centre Hintalovon’s advocacy typically focuses on: keeping robust child-protection duties rejecting measures that break end-to-end encryption ensuring any detection is targeted, necessary and proportionate and building strong redress, transparency and safeguards for children’s rights to privacy, expression and protection The European Parliament has sought a privacy-protective balance the file remains highly contested in Council','2025-10-21 13:16:32'),(331004,'2) Digital Services Act (DSA) and minors’ protection guidance (2025)','2025-10-21 13:16:32'),(331005,'DSA already bans targeted ads based on minors’ data, mandates risk assessments and mitigation for systemic risks (eg, harmful content, exploitation), and requires age-appropriate design by very large platforms In July 2025, the Commission issued practical guidelines listing proportionate measures against grooming, harmful content, cyberbullying, addictive design and unfair commercial practices Hintalovon presses for strict enforcement in Hungary (risk assessments, age-appropriate design, meaningful child participation in audits) and for remedies when platforms fall short','2025-10-21 13:16:33'),(331006,'3) EU Strategy for a More Effective Fight Against Child Sexual Abuse (2020–2025)','2025-10-21 13:16:33'),(331007,'This policy framework underpins legislation and funding (eg, hotlines, law-enforcement tools, victim support) Advocacy priorities include survivor-centred services, rapid takedown across borders, capacity for police and hotlines, prevention (including work with people at risk of offending), and rigorous evidence standards for detection technologies','2025-10-21 13:16:33'),(331008,'4) EU Strategy on the Rights of the Child (2021) & the European Child Guarantee (2021)','2025-10-21 13:16:33'),(331009,'These set the horizontal agenda: participation of children in policymaking protection from all forms of violence and measures against poverty and exclusion (free/effective access to ECEC, school meals, healthcare, housing) Hintalovon uses these as levers for national reforms, monitoring Hungary’s Child Guarantee plan and pushing for measurable targets, budgets and accountability','2025-10-21 13:16:33'),(331010,'5) Directive (EU) 2024/1385 on combating violence against women and domestic violence','2025-10-21 13:16:33'),(331011,'The first EU-wide law on VAW/DV also tackles cyber-violence (non-consensual image-sharing, cyber-stalking, cyber-harassment) Because girls are disproportionately affected and children are often direct or indirect victims, Hintalovon works on child-sensitive transposition: specialized services, safe reporting, digital-evidence handling, and prevention in schools','2025-10-21 13:16:33'),(331012,'6) Recast Anti-Trafficking Directive (EU) 2024/1712','2025-10-21 13:16:33'),(331013,'The 2024 revision strengthens tools against trafficking, including online facilitation, expands offences (eg, forced marriage and illegal adoption contexts), and criminalises the knowing use of services provided by victims Hintalovon’s asks: stronger identification of child victims (including from institutions), non-punishment, trauma-informed care, and cross-border cooperation with child-specific guardianship and procedures','2025-10-21 13:16:33'),(331014,'7) Better Internet for Kids (BIK+) strategy (2022)','2025-10-21 13:16:33'),(331015,'BIK+ is the digital arm of the child-rights strategy, promoting age-appropriate services, media literacy, and support networks (Safer Internet Centres) Hintalovon leverages BIK+ to advocate for sustainable funding of helplines/hotlines, high-quality prevention content, and systematic parental support','2025-10-21 13:16:33'),(331016,'EU Green Deal, EU Textile Strategy, EU Circular Economy Action Plan, EU Corporate Sustainability Due Diligence, EU Ecodesign for Sustainable Products Regulation','2025-10-21 13:16:33'),(331017,'UAV/drones\' policies and regulatory frameworks that governs the field of autonomous vehicles in European Union (European drones legislation)','2025-10-21 13:16:34'),(331018,'The main activities are directed towards the digitalisation of international freight transport documentation and digital reporting to the public authorities( n)( n)The actions are directed towards both national and European organisations, institutions and businesses The most active work in the near past has been contribution to the preparation discussions and the consultation of the eFTI Regulation (2020/1065) and the contribiution to DIGINNO eCMR working group and DIGINNO-Proto project In the latter, the Initative/Cluster put forward the eCMR indexing concept and architecture and participated in the testing of the prototype live','2025-10-21 13:16:35'),(331019,'The 2021 onwaards work has been targeted on eFTI Regulation (2020/1056), its implementing and delegated acts as well as taking note of actions taking place in eFTI4EU and eFTI4ALL projects','2025-10-21 13:16:35'),(331020,'AMARANTE follows institutional activities which are related to security worldwide and to the private security sector','2025-10-21 13:16:35'),(331021,'For example :','2025-10-21 13:16:35'),(331022,'- News and decisions from the EEAS','2025-10-21 13:16:35'),(331023,'- News and decisions from the DG DEVCO','2025-10-21 13:16:35'),(331024,'- Parliamentary activities such as reports on private security','2025-10-21 13:16:35'),(331025,'Medicinal products for human use','2025-10-21 13:16:36'),(331026,'Committee on the Environment, Public Health and Food Safety','2025-10-21 13:16:36'),(331027,'Regulation on guidelines for trans-European energy infrastructure (TEN-E Regulation)','2025-10-21 13:16:37'),(331028,'Electrification Action Plan','2025-10-21 13:16:37'),(331029,'European Grids Package','2025-10-21 13:16:37'),(331030,'Our focus is water and climate change So we focus on all policy issues and legislation in these areas Examples include:','2025-10-21 13:16:38'),(331031,'Urban Wastewater Treatment Directive','2025-10-21 13:16:38'),(331032,'Concessions Directive','2025-10-21 13:16:38'),(331033,'Emissions Directive','2025-10-21 13:16:38'),(331034,'- Regulation on animal by-products','2025-10-21 13:16:38'),(331035,'- Regulation on certain transmissible spongiform encephalopathies (TSE)','2025-10-21 13:16:38'),(331036,'- Renewable Energy Directive (RED)','2025-10-21 13:16:38'),(331037,'- ReFuelUE Aviation Regulation','2025-10-21 13:16:38'),(331038,'- Directive on EU Emissions Trading System (EU ETS)','2025-10-21 13:16:38'),(331039,'- Regulations on CO2 emission performance standards for light and heavy-duty vehicles','2025-10-21 13:16:38'),(331040,'Digital Services Act, Digital Markets Act, DSM Directive, Rental and Lending Rights Directive, Creative Europe Regulation, Competition policy (mergers), Horizon Europe Regulation, InvestEU Regulation, Geo-blocking Regulation, Collective Rights Management Directive, AI Act, Late Payment Directive, etc','2025-10-21 13:16:39'),(331041,'Digital Fairness Act, DSA, DMA, digital taxation, privacy, competition and anti-trust, GPSR, PLD, Toy Safety, ESPR, Taxonomy, Packaging regulation, AI, Animal welfare, Waste Framework Directive, End of Live Vehicles, Circular Economy Act, Digital Omnibus, INI report on the Implementation and streamlining of EU internal market rules to strengthen the single market 2024/2119(INI)','2025-10-21 13:16:43'),(331042,'Momenteel focussen wij ons op de :','2025-10-21 13:16:44'),(331043,'Revision of TPD 2 Directive','2025-10-21 13:16:44'),(331044,'Revision of the EU Tobacco Taxation Directive','2025-10-21 13:16:44'),(331045,'richtlijn 2014/40 TPD 2 Art 15 track en trace','2025-10-21 13:16:44'),(331046,'EP Declarations, Resolutions and other initiatives on the topic of patient engagement, precision medicine, maternal health, gender equality, work-life balance, minorities and mobility within Europe Examples include:','2025-10-21 13:16:45'),(331047,'1 IHI Calls','2025-10-21 13:16:45'),(331048,'2 Declaration 0015 on universal access to maternal healthcare','2025-10-21 13:16:45'),(331049,'3 European Commission Public Consultation on possible action addressing the challenges of work-life balance faced by working parents and caregivers','2025-10-21 13:16:45'),(331050,'4 European Commission Public Consultation on Expert Panel on effective ways of investing in Health (EXPH) - Preliminary opinion on ‘Access to health services in the EU’’','2025-10-21 13:16:45'),(331051,'The following EP Committees: ENVI, DROI, FEMM, DEVE, EMPL','2025-10-21 13:16:45'),(331052,'List of contributions to public consultations:','2025-10-21 13:16:46'),(331053,'- EU climate target for 2040','2025-10-21 13:16:46'),(331054,'- Platform on Sustainable Finance (PSF)','2025-10-21 13:16:46'),(331055,'- EU Carbon Border Adjustment Mechanism (CBAM)','2025-10-21 13:16:46'),(331056,'- Sustainable Finance Disclosure Regulation (SFDR)','2025-10-21 13:16:46'),(331057,'- Corporate Sustainability Reporting Directive (CSRD)','2025-10-21 13:16:46'),(331058,'- Methane Regulation (EU/2024/1787)','2025-10-21 13:16:46'),(331059,'Climate Bonds Initiative Europe aims (i) to ensure that the Paris agreement goals are taken into account when sustainable finance legislation is drawn (ii) to ensure that the EU Taxonomy is science based and becomes a non-disputable guide to green investments (iii) to ensure that the Climate Law is implemented in full and the EU sets ambitious 2040 climate targets (iv) to mainstream transition finance in order to secure a net zero EU economy by 2050 (v) to highlight credible transition pathways for hard to abate sectors and the buildings sectors (vi) to phase out coal, oil and gas as an energy fuel (vii) to raise awareness of the climate bonds market and (viii) to redirect public and private capital towards zero emission investments','2025-10-21 13:16:46'),(331060,'LAS RELACIONADAS CON:','2025-10-21 13:16:47'),(331061,'- PRODUCCIÓN ANIMAL','2025-10-21 13:16:47'),(331062,'- BIENESTAR ANIMAL','2025-10-21 13:16:47'),(331063,'- PROPUESTA DE REGLAMENTO SOBRE BIENESTAR ANIMAL EN EL TRANSPORTE','2025-10-21 13:16:47'),(331064,'- SOSTENIBILIDAD','2025-10-21 13:16:47'),(331065,'- SEGURIDAD ALIMENTARIA','2025-10-21 13:16:47'),(331066,'- MERCADOS','2025-10-21 13:16:47'),(331067,'- ORDENACIÓN SECTORIAL','2025-10-21 13:16:47'),(331068,'- INDUSTRIA Y COMERCIO','2025-10-21 13:16:47'),(331069,'- DIRECTIVA EMISIONES INDUSTRIALES','2025-10-21 13:16:47'),(331070,'- REPowerEU Plan','2025-10-21 13:16:48'),(331071,'- EU Industrial Policy','2025-10-21 13:16:48'),(331072,'- EU Energy Policy','2025-10-21 13:16:48'),(331073,'- EU Neighborhood Policy (ENP)','2025-10-21 13:16:48'),(331074,'- European Neighborhood Instrument (ENI)','2025-10-21 13:16:48'),(331075,'- EU Development Cooperation Policy','2025-10-21 13:16:48'),(331076,'- EU Global Gateway','2025-10-21 13:16:48'),(331077,'We have been nominated as an observer for the Expert Group on Fertilizing Products','2025-10-21 13:16:48'),(331078,'Our Secretary-General is also expert in the Soil Health Expert Group as well as the Carbon Removals EG','2025-10-21 13:16:48'),(331079,'We are currently following: CRCF, NZIA, ETS, The 2030 Climate Target Plan','2025-10-21 13:16:48'),(331080,'Our company is a member of Group of Experts on the Smart Tachograph','2025-10-21 13:16:49'),(331081,'Konventionen om rättigheter för personer med funktionsnedsättning SDR är medlem i Europeiska unionen för döva EUD','2025-10-21 13:16:50'),(331082,'Hemos sido invitados por Sophie Wilmes, Presidenta del Grupo de Monitoreo de Democracia, Estado de Derecho y Derechos Fundamentales (DRFMG), establecido en la Comisión de Libertades Civiles, Justicia y Asuntos de interior (LIBE) del parlamento Europeo para intercambio de opiniones sobre la situación de la democracia, el estado de derecho y los derechos fundamentales en España','2025-10-21 13:16:51'),(331083,'COM(2025)0046: The road to the next multiannual financial framework, Commission document: D-COM(2025)0046','2025-10-21 13:16:51'),(331084,'Link: https://oeilsecureeuroparleuropaeu/oeil/en/procedure-file/pdf?reference=COM(2025)0046','2025-10-21 13:16:51'),(331085,'Alle Versicherungsmakler und KMU Versicherer betreffende Gesetzgebungsverfahren und Regulierungen wie INSURANCE DISTRIBUTION DIRECTIVE - IDD, Reail Investment Strategy - RIS, Markets in Financial Instruments Directive - MiFID2, Taxonomie','2025-10-21 13:16:52'),(331086,'* Mobility: sustainable urban mobility, emis