g Regulation','2025-10-21 13:18:54'),(331622,'- the European Reference Networks','2025-10-21 13:18:54'),(331623,'in order to make sure no child suffering of cancer is forgotten in Europe','2025-10-21 13:18:54'),(331624,'EASAC works in three broad programmes: Environment, Energy, and Biosciences and Public Health It provides relevant in-depth information for upcoming topics of the EU institutions within and across these programmes','2025-10-21 13:18:55'),(331625,'- REPowerEurope','2025-10-21 13:18:56'),(331626,'- Reform des Strommarktdesigns inkl REMIT-RL','2025-10-21 13:18:56'),(331627,'- Erneuerbaren Energien-RL, Energieeffizienz-RL & Gebäudeenergieeffizienz-RL, ETS I & ETS II, CBAM, Sozialer Klimafond, Lastenverteilungs-VO','2025-10-21 13:18:56'),(331628,'- Reform des Gas-Paketes (RL & VO) inkl Wasserstoffstrategie und Methan-VO','2025-10-21 13:18:56'),(331629,'- Finanzmarktregulierung / Sustainable Finance / Taxonomy','2025-10-21 13:18:56'),(331630,'- Energieinfrastrukturausbau','2025-10-21 13:18:56'),(331631,'- Energiesicherheit / EU-Energieaußenpolitik','2025-10-21 13:18:56'),(331632,'- Klimaschutzpolitik: Klimaschutzziele 2040','2025-10-21 13:18:56'),(331633,'- Umweltpolitik: Kreislaufwirtschaft, Biodiversitätsstrategie, Gesetz zur Wiederherstellung der Natur, F-Gas-VO, Industrieemissions-RL, CCS/CCUS (EU- Industrial Carbon Management Strategy) - CO2 Entnahmezertifizierung, Ecodesign-RL, Bodenstrategie inkl Bodenmonitoring-Gesetzgebung','2025-10-21 13:18:56'),(331634,'- Digitalisierungspolitik und Telekommunikationspolitik','2025-10-21 13:18:56'),(331635,'- Mobilität: Elektromobilität: Ausbau der Infrastruktur für alternative Kraftstoffe, CO2 Flottengrenzwerte','2025-10-21 13:18:56'),(331636,'- EU-Wettbewerbspolitik: NZIA und CRMA, EU- Lieferkettengesetz, VO von Verbot von Produkten unter Zwangsarbeit','2025-10-21 13:18:56'),(331637,'Advocacy with EU institutions and EU Member States to build support for the International Criminal Court (ICC) and international justice in the EU and around the world Specific policies targeted include the Council decision and its associated action plan on the ICC the EU Action Plan on Human Rights and Democracy the EU Policy Framework on Support to Transitional Justice the EU Toolkit on Advancing the Complementarity Principle and the EU Guidelines on Promoting Compliance with International Humanitarian Law','2025-10-21 13:18:58'),(331638,'Sustainable Use Directive','2025-10-21 13:18:59'),(331639,'Fertilizing Products Regulation no 1069/2009','2025-10-21 13:18:59'),(331640,'Regulation on plant protection products no 1107/2009','2025-10-21 13:18:59'),(331641,'CCDH focuses its policy work on advancing online safety legislation In the EU, this is related to the implementation of the Digital Services Act, the AI Act, and to a limited extent the Digital Markets Act The Center works on a range of issues, from climate change to public health, to children\'s rights online, so there may be relevant legislation additionally impacted in those topic areas','2025-10-21 13:18:59'),(331642,'Cordaid engages with various EU legislative proposals and policies related to international development, humanitarian assistance, human rights, climate change, and other relevant areas These engagements include advocacy efforts, policy analysis, and collaboration with policymakers to influence decision-making processes Cordaid works to influence key decision-makers to ensure that EU policies affecting poor countries have a far reaching, positive impact on lives of people living in fragility','2025-10-21 13:19:00'),(331643,'Cordaid\'s work spans numerous policy areas including development policy,  approach to aid effectiveness, fragility and crisis management, and the provision of humanitarian assistance to victims of conflicts and natural disasters We  join forces with allied NGOs and civil society organizations','2025-10-21 13:19:00'),(331644,'European Union Space Programme, Space Strategy for Security and Defence','2