l Digital Product Passport (DPP)','2025-10-21 13:19:59'),(331954,'Rilevanza per Reeco: Reeco integra i principi dell\'ESPR attraverso la certificazione e la tracciabilità dei materiali riciclati, contribuendo a dimostrare la sostenibilità dei prodotti e ad allinearsi al passaporto digitale del prodotto (DPP)','2025-10-21 13:19:59'),(331955,'3 Strategia per i prodotti tessili sostenibili e circolari','2025-10-21 13:19:59'),(331956,'Descrizione: Questa strategia specifica si concentra sull\'industria tessile, promuovendo un uso più efficiente delle risorse, materiali riciclati, e modelli di business circolari Introduce requisiti per la tracciabilità e la trasparenza lungo tutta la filiera','2025-10-21 13:19:59'),(331957,'Rilevanza per Reeco: Essendo focalizzato sul settore tessile e sull\'uso di materiali naturali e riciclati, Reeco è in linea con questa strategia, offrendo strumenti per garantire conformità e promuovere pratiche circolari','2025-10-21 13:19:59'),(331958,'4 European Climate Law','2025-10-21 13:19:59'),(331959,'Descrizione: Questa legge vincola legalmente l\'UE a diventare neutrale in termini di emissioni di carbonio entro il 2050 Stabilisce obiettivi intermedi di riduzione delle emissioni di gas serra, promuovendo tecnologie e pratiche a basse emissioni','2025-10-21 13:19:59'),(331960,'Rilevanza per Reeco: Reeco aiuta i brand a monitorare e ridurre le emissioni associate ai materiali, contribuendo agli obiettivi climatici europei','2025-10-21 13:19:59'),(331961,'5 Regolamento sulla catena del valore e la due diligence aziendale (Corporate Sustainability Due Diligence Directive - CSDD)','2025-10-21 13:19:59'),(331962,'Descrizione: Impone alle aziende di integrare la sostenibilità nelle loro catene di approvvigionamento e di identificare, prevenire e mitigare gli impatti ambientali e sociali','2025-10-21 13:19:59'),(331963,'Rilevanza per Reeco: Il sistema di tracciabilità e certificazione di Reeco supporta le aziende nell\'adempimento degli obblighi di due diligence richiesti dalla normativa','2025-10-21 13:19:59'),(331964,'6 Regolamento sui rifiuti tessili (Circular Economy Action Plan)','2025-10-21 13:19:59'),(331965,'Descrizione: Parte del Piano d\'Azione per l\'Economia Circolare, mira a ridurre gli sprechi tessili attraverso il riutilizzo e il riciclo, introducendo requisiti per il design circolare e la gestione dei rifiuti tessili','2025-10-21 13:19:59'),(331966,'Rilevanza per Reeco: Reeco contribuisce a valorizzare materiali di scarto, come il \"tô\", classificandoli come pre-consumer waste e certificandone l\'utilizzo nei prodotti tessili','2025-10-21 13:19:59'),(331967,'7 European Green Taxonomy (ECGT - Tassonomia Verde Europea)','2025-10-21 13:19:59'),(331968,'Descrizione: Un sistema di classificazione che definisce quali attività economiche possono essere considerate sostenibili dal punto di vista ambientale, promuovendo investimenti green','2025-10-21 13:19:59'),(331969,'Rilevanza per Reeco: Reeco aiuta le aziende a soddisfare i criteri della tassonomia verde, certificando l\'uso di materiali riciclati e il rispetto degli standard ambientali','2025-10-21 13:19:59'),(331970,'8 Regolamento sul Digital Product Passport (DPP)','2025-10-21 13:19:59'),(331971,'Descrizione: Questo regolamento richiede che i prodotti immessi sul mercato europeo siano accompagnati da un passaporto digitale, che fornisce informazioni su sostenibilità, tracciabilità e conformità','2025-10-21 13:19:59'),(331972,'Rilevanza per Reeco: Reeco si integra perfettamente con il DPP, offrendo certificazione dei materiali riciclati e tracciabilità completa attraverso QR code','2025-10-21 13:19:59'),(331973,'Legislation of seed marketing, plant protection products, patents, plant breeders\' rights, regulation of biotechnology & GM, regulation of plant protection products','2025-10-21 13:20:00'),(331974,'The association supports the policies aiming at the achievement of the following objectives:','2025-10-21 13:20:01'),(331975,'Ensure universal and continuous access and learning through the acquisition and renewal of the basic skills and know-how necessary to guarantee the active participation in the society of knowledge','2025-10-21 13:20:01'),(331976,'Ensure visible investment levels in human resources in order to give priority to the most important potential en Europe: its inhabitants','2025-10-21 13:20:01'),(331977,'Develop efficient education and learning methods and frameworks for the continuation of learning throughout one’s life','2025-10-21 13:20:01'),(331978,'Improve significantly the level of understanding and assessment of the participation to learning and of its results, especially for what regards non-formal and informal learning','2025-10-21 13:20:01'),(331979,'See to it that any individual can accede easily throughout its life to quality information and orientation on the learning opportunities in Europe','2025-10-21 13:20:01'),(331980,'Offer permanent education opportunities as close as possible to the students, within their communities, if necessary with the support of ICT structures','2025-10-21 13:20:01'),(331981,'Promote a pattern of “inclusive” society able to assure for each individual the equality of opportunity in the access to quality permanent education, whereby education and training rely first and foremost on the individual needs and demands','2025-10-21 13:20:01'),(331982,'Adapt the education and training methods and the organisation of work in order to allow people to participate in the permanent education actions and to reconcile learning, professional life and family life','2025-10-21 13:20:01'),(331983,'Reach high educational and qualification levels in all sectors, in order to ensure educational and cultural actions, quality training patterns, while ensuring that the individuals’ knowledge and skills coincide with the changing demand as far as professional profiles, organisation and work methods are concerned','2025-10-21 13:20:01'),(331984,'Encourage and allow the individuals to participate more actively in all the realms of modern public life, especially in the social and political life at all levels, including European','2025-10-21 13:20:01'),(331985,'Further the wage-earners’ selective retraining and the installation of professional services','2025-10-21 13:20:01'),(331986,'ESBB particularly targets the EU strategies \"EU Health Strategy\" and \"EU Data Strategy\" Furthermore, ESBB particularly targets the following EU legislative policies: \"EU Health Policy\" with legislation adoption in pharmaceuticals & medical devices (pharmacovigilance, falsified medicines, clinical trials) and Organs, blood, tissue and cells \"Blood, tissues, cells and organs\" \"Cancer\" \"Data Protection\" \"Digital Health\" \"Education and Training\" \"Endocrine disruptors including human biomonitoring\" \"European reference networks\" \"Health data collection\" \"Rare diseases\" and \"Research and innovation as well as Research and innovation in health\"','2025-10-21 13:20:02'),(331987,'EU Kulturpolitik (European Agenda for Culture, EU Workplan for Culture,)','2025-10-21 13:20:02'),(331988,'EU Kulturförderprogramme (Creative Europe,)','2025-10-21 13:20:02'),(331989,'TTIP/Kultur und Handel','2025-10-21 13:20:02'),(331990,'Visapolitik','2025-10-21 13:20:02'),(331991,'EU Directives related to safety and security of explosives and hazardous materials (dangerous goods)','2025-10-21 13:20:03'),(331992,'Corporate Reporting Reform','2025-10-21 13:20:04'),(331993,'Revisorforordningen','2025-10-21 13:20:04'),(331994,'Política agrícola común, medio ambiente, comercio, mercado único y seguridad alimentaria','2025-10-21 13:20:04'),(331995,'Youth Employment Support: a Bridge to Jobs for the Next Generation','2025-10-21 13:20:05'),(331996,'On the European democracy action plan','2025-10-21 13:20:05'),(331997,'CHARTER OF FUNDAMENTAL RIGHTS OF THE EUROPEAN UNION','2025-10-21 13:20:05'),(331998,'The Common Security and Defence Policy (CSDP)','2025-10-21 13:20:05'),(