, in nachhaltigen Lieferketten, sowie Rechtsstaatlichkeit und Menschenwürde für Kinder und ihre Familien auf der Flucht','2025-10-21 13:22:01'),(332532,'We follow files involving Civil Society, Democracy, Elections interference, Cybersecurity, Security, Economic growth and countering economic coercion','2025-10-21 13:22:02'),(332533,'Uns ist vor allem die Lebensmittelqualität und die Lebensmittelsicherheit ein ganz besonderes Anliegen','2025-10-21 13:22:03'),(332534,'air quality, healthcare, environment, air pollution, education and training, climate action, sustainable healthcare','2025-10-21 13:22:04'),(332535,'- Development cooperation policies','2025-10-21 13:22:04'),(332536,'- Global gateway operational plans','2025-10-21 13:22:04'),(332537,'- EU Neighbourhood democracy support plans','2025-10-21 13:22:04'),(332538,'Digital policy, including initiatives linked to platform regulation, Competition, Consumer protection, Privacy/Data protection and data-related initiatives, Taxation, Payment Regulation, AI, initiatives linked to tourism such as Package Travel Directive and Passenger Rights Regulation as well as initiatives on sustainable tourism, STR-related regulation','2025-10-21 13:22:06'),(332539,'Internationale handel en investeringen','2025-10-21 13:22:09'),(332540,'Onze organisatie faciliteert markttoegang en handelsbetrekkingen tussen Europese bedrijven en Tanzania We volgen actief het Europese handelsbeleid, inclusief bilaterale partnerschappen en investeringsakkoorden met Afrikaanse landen','2025-10-21 13:22:09'),(332541,'Ontwikkelingssamenwerking en externe betrekkingen','2025-10-21 13:22:09'),(332542,'We ondersteunen projecten die bijdragen aan duurzame ontwikkeling en economische groei in Oost-Afrika, en volgen hierbij nauwgezet het EU-beleid inzake ontwikkelingssamenwerking, met name het NDICI (Neighbourhood, Development and International Cooperation Instrument)','2025-10-21 13:22:09'),(332543,'Duurzaamheid en verantwoord ondernemen','2025-10-21 13:22:09'),(332544,'Vuka Consulting stimuleert duurzaam en ethisch ondernemen We hechten belang aan EU-beleidsinitiatieven rond Corporate Sustainability Due Diligence, mensenrechten in waardeketens, en milieustandaarden, vooral in sectoren als mijnbouw, energie en landbouw','2025-10-21 13:22:09'),(332545,'Digitale transitie en innovatie','2025-10-21 13:22:09'),(332546,'We volgen het EU-beleid rond digitalisering, met het oog op het bevorderen van technologische samenwerking tussen Europa en Afrikaanse partners, onder meer in de context van capacity building en digital inclusion','2025-10-21 13:22:09'),(332547,'Beleid inzake kleine en middelgrote ondernemingen (KMO’s)','2025-10-21 13:22:09'),(332548,'Onze diensten zijn gericht op het ondersteunen van Europese KMO’s bij hun internationale expansie We volgen EU-initiatieven die KMO’s helpen bij export, marktverkenning en internationale samenwerking','2025-10-21 13:22:09'),(332549,'Révision de la législation pharmaceutique','2025-10-21 13:22:10'),(332550,'Directive sur le traitement des eaux usées en ville','2025-10-21 13:22:10'),(332551,'Programme Horizon Europe','2025-10-21 13:22:10'),(332552,'Stratégie européenne pour les données','2025-10-21 13:22:10'),(332553,'\"Scanorama\" aims to become not only a model of film culture but also of social responsibility Festival focus - implementing universal design principles and integrating them into most areas of the festival The goal is to ensure that as many people as possible, regardless of their physical, sensory, or social abilities, can fully participate in cultural events Working with socially vulnerable groups, the festival aims to maintain a balance between free and paid film screenings Discounts on tickets are offered to seniors, people with disabilities, students, and schoolchildren Depending on financial capabilities, the festival strives to adapt films for distribution to people with visual and hearing impairments Arrangements are made for attendees with disabilities to comfortably attend and participate in the festival (locations are adapted for those with mobility impairments, films can be watched from home, and the festival collaborates with organizations uniting individuals with disabilities or special needs, such as the Lithuanian Autism Association \"Rain Children\")','2025-10-21 13:22:10'),(332554,'The \"Scanorama\" team and volunteers are trained in disability awareness and universal design principles','2025-10-21 13:22:10'),(332555,'During the festival, screenings and educational programs for youth and families are organized, and public discussions on relevant topics are initiated, involving cinema and broader cultural field professionals Outside of the festival season, the festival team organizes satellite events, such as the early cinema festival \"First Wave,\" the \"Scanorama Summer\" project aimed at raising the level of cinema culture in the regions, and will distribute the most popular festival films in Lithuanian cinemas Additionally, they will organize special educational programs for the regions, free film camps for children and youth, thus expanding the space for European cinema dissemination and cultivating targeted audience groups','2025-10-21 13:22:10'),(332556,'\"Scanorama\" actively participates in the international network of seven European film festivals, \"Moving Images – Open Borders\" (MIOB), and has been coordinating the network for the past two years One of the network\'s key priorities is environmental neutrality in its activities The festival is committed to continuing the implementation of sustainability practices, contributing to environmental initiatives within the film industry The network’s environmental project, \"Green Charter for Film Festivals,\" presented at the Cannes Film Festival, created a tool for tracking festival pollution, analyzing statistics, and enhancing sustainability In 2022, during the \"SCA Directions\" series of industry events, the Charter project was introduced to Lithuanian film festivals by the project\'s initiator, Guillaume Callopas, one of the heads of the French \"Les Arcs\" festival','2025-10-21 13:22:10'),(332557,'Preposition and Stockpile of Medical Countermeasure\'s in case of a Mass Casualty Event on the European Continent','2025-10-21 13:22:11'),(332558,'Plan d\'investissement pour l\'Europe, Paquet Economique Circulaire, Union énergétique, Stratégie du marché intérieur pour les biens et les services, initiatives sur les smart-resilient cities, Paquet routier','2025-10-21 13:22:12'),(332559,'Biocides - Regulation 528/2012','2025-10-21 13:22:14'),(332560,'Organic Regulation 848/2018','2025-10-21 13:22:14'),(332561,'EU Plastic and micro-plastic policy','2025-10-21 13:22:14'),(332562,'Non-Energy Extractive Industries and Natura 2000','2025-10-21 13:22:14'),(332563,'Birds Directive','2025-10-21 13:22:14'),(332564,'DRVs for sodium and chloride','2025-10-21 13:22:14'),(332565,'Harmonisation iodine','2025-10-21 13:22:14'),(332566,'Extractive sector','2025-10-21 13:22:14'),(332567,'Sustainable Agricultural Production','2025-10-21 13:22:14'),(332568,'NACE code revision','2025-10-21 13:22:14'),(332569,'Gentechnik-Gesetzgebung','2025-10-21 13:22:15'),(332570,'WGG Gesetzesvorschlag zu den Neuen Genomischen Techniken, Green Deal','2025-10-21 13:22:15'),(332571,'Suggestions to enable the development of genome editing in Europe (https://sdb16ba23c36c1871jimcontentcom/download/version/1616066435/module/12710326199/name/AFBV-WGG%20Explanatory%20Note%20-%20revised%20in%20March%202021pdf','2025-10-21 13:22:15'),(332572,'Proposals for (1) a coherent interpretation of the GMO definition of EU Directive 2001/18/EC, (2) designation of an EU authority for GMO status determination and (3) engagement in discussions with agricultural exporters and importers to harmonize the regulatory status of plants derived from genome-editing technologies (https://sdb16ba23c36c1871jimcontentcom/download/version/1540365465/module/12172550799/name/Letter%20to%20the%20Commission_%2018%20July%2020pdf','2025-10-21 13:22:15'),(332573,'Regarding the current discussion of more advanced nonselective herbicide technologies in Europe (https://wwwgdchde/netzwerk-strukturen/fachstrukturen/seniorexperten-chemie/oeffentlichkeitsarbeit/offener-brief-an-eu-zu-glyphosathtml)','2025-10-21 13:22:15'),(332574,'Regarding the current discussion of more advanced nonselective herbicide technologies in Europe, focus on Surfactants used in Glyphosate Based Herbicides (https://wwwgdchde/fileadmin/downloads/Netzwerk_und_Strukturen/Fachgruppen/Seniorexperten/Sonstige/Open_Letter_Glyphosate/2OffBrief_EU-Commisionpdf)','2025-10-21 13:22:15'),(332575,'Update zu den laufenden Diskussionen über den Regulierungsvorschlag der Europäischen Kommission über Neue Genomische Techniken (NGTs)','2025-10-21 13:22:15'),(332576,'Empfehlungen zum Trilog: https://wwwwggevde/ngt-regulierung-kommissionsvorschlag-update-empfehlungen-trilog/','2025-10-21 13:22:15'),(332577,'Trade defence measures','2025-10-21 13:22:15'),(332578,'New Clean Industrial act  for the support of greener energy source (wind energy or thermal insulation energy)','2025-10-21 13:22:15'),(332579,'Support a recycling supply chain with dedicated waste code for Composites end of life materials','2025-10-21 13:22:15'),(332580,'1 Technology & Digital Policy','2025-10-21 13:22:16'),(332581,'We strive to build a harmonised and trustworthy Digital Single Market Our engagement focuses on shaping core digital legislation, including the AI Act, Data Act, Digital Services Act (DSA), and cybersecurity frameworks like the NIS2 Directive and the Cyber Resilience Act We provide technical expertise to ensure these regulations are innovation-friendly and workable','2025-10-21 13:22:16'),(332582,'2 Research & Innovation (R&I) Policy','2025-10-21 13:22:16'),(332583,'Our goal is to foster a world-class R&I ecosystem in Europe We actively influence the strategic direction and biennial Work Programmes of Horizon Europe, the EU\'s flagship funding programme, advocating for simplified participation rules and fair intellectual property (IP) provisions','2025-10-21 13:22:16'),(332584,'3 Regulatory Policy & Better Regulation','2025-10-21 13:22:16'),(332585,'This horizontal commitment ensures all EU policy is evidence-based, proportionate, and predictable We champion the EU’s Better Regulation principles across all our advocacy work','2025-10-21 13:22:16'),(332586,'migration and asylum','2025-10-21 13:22:17'),(332587,'Fundamental Rights and Citizenship','2025-10-21 13:22:17'),(332588,'social innovation','2025-10-21 13:22:17'),(332589,'Roots of Peace is going to contribute to various aspects of European Green Deal, EU Common agriculture policy, EU civil protection and humanitarian aid','2025-10-21 13:22:17'),(332590,'EfVET has been very active in its policy advocacy work for vocational education in this few years and was a strong contacts with the European Commission and other European Institutions','2025-10-21 13:22:18'),(332591,'in 2014 and 2015 EfVET was or be involved in the policy  implementation of DG-EAC, DG- Employer, Social Affairs and Inclusion and other institutions\' initiatives where it introduced a strong civil society perspective by providing the point of view of EfVET members','2025-10-21 13:22:18'),(332592,'EfVET has had regular contact with the Vocational Training and Adult education unit in DG- EMPLOYMENT SOCIAL AFFAIRS AND INCLUSION Informal meetings were happening throughout the year, and regular exchanges about plans and opinions took place','2025-10-21 13:22:18'),(332593,'Furthermore EfVET participates in the Working Groups on:','2025-10-21 13:22:18'),(332594,'- Advisory Group EQF','2025-10-21 13:22:18'),(332595,'- European Quality Assurance Reference Framework (EQARF)','2025-10-21 13:22:18'),(332596,'- Launched the European Alliance for Apprenticeships (EAFA)','2025-10-21 13:22:18'),(332597,'- ET2020 on Innovation and Digitalisation','2025-10-21 13:22:18'),(332598,'- European Social Funding (ESF)','2025-10-21 13:22:18'),(332599,'- CEDEFOP','2025-10-21 13:22:18'),(332600,'- Pact for Skills','2025-10-21 13:22:18'),(332601,'- VET & Green Transition','2025-10-21 13:22:18'),(332602,'- Working Group 2020 Innovation and Digitalisation','2025-10-21 13:22:18'),(332603,'Also, via the European Civil Society Platform on Lifelong Learning (EUCIS-LLL),ALL DIGITAL, the relationship with other units in DG- EAC and DG-EMPL has been reinforced and EfVET has been very active in the stakeholder initiatives EfVET also participated in the LLL week and in the EC Education Forum in Brussels','2025-10-21 13:22:18'),(332604,'Also, EfVET was invited along with the other five Association members of VET4EU2 group to participate in the Meeting of the Ministers in charge of Vocational Education and Training (VET), the European Social Partners and the European Commission which was held 21-22 June 2015 in Riga, organised under the Latvian Presidency of the Council of the European Union in cooperation with the European Commission','2025-10-21 13:22:18'),(332605,'Also, we a part of the VET Skills week in Brussels, Vienna, Finland and onlines','2025-10-21 13:22:18'),(332606,'Umsetzung der Europäischen Säule sozialer Rechte','2025-10-21 13:22:20'),(332607,'Umsetzung der UN-Nachhaltigkeitsziele (SDG)','2025-10-21 13:22:20'),(332608,'Europäisches Semester','2025-10-21 13:22:20'),(332609,'Soziale und Gesundheitsdienste in Europa, einschl Rahmengesetzgebung wie Beihilfe-, Vergabe- und Steuerrecht','2025-10-21 13:22:20'),(332610,'Soziale Klimapolitik und Maßnahmen für eine sozial-ökologische Transformation','2025-10-21 13:22:20'),(332611,'Armutsbekämpfung und Umsetzung der EU-Kindergarantie','2025-10-21 13:22:20'),(332612,'EU-Initiativen in den Bereichen soziale Eingliederung, Alterssicherung und Gesundheit/Langzeitpflege','2025-10-21 13:22:20'),(332613,'EU-Rahmenbedingungen für die Sozialwirtschaft und soziale Innovationen','2025-10-21 13:22:20'),(332614,'Demografie