cts pertaining to RFNBOs), Red II and its relevant application for the production of green hydrogen and its derivatives, electricity market reform, Net Zero Industry Act','2025-10-21 13:22:27'),(332654,'Apart from participation of two EIPA employees in the abovementioned Expert Group on Public Administration and Governance as observer, our Institute has one employee participating in the Expert Group on European Judicial Training for DG Justice and Consumers','2025-10-21 13:22:28'),(332655,'Interest in all matters in connection with DG INTPA and DG NEAR','2025-10-21 13:22:29'),(332656,'We are mostly interested in the activities of the EU institutions concerning Global Gateway Initiative','2025-10-21 13:22:29'),(332657,'Renewable Energy Directive II (including revision), Fit for 55, Circular Economy, Chemicals and Industry legislation, Waste Framework Directive, ETS, IED, Taxonomy, RefuelEU Maritime, ReFuelEU Aviation, Clean Industrial Deal, Sustainable Transport Investment Plan, Circular Economy Act, Bioeconomy Strategy','2025-10-21 13:22:30'),(332658,'(1) Charter of Fundamental Rights of the European Union and respect of the rule of law in the EU','2025-10-21 13:22:30'),(332659,'(2) Interinstitutional Agreement of 20 May 2021 between the European Parliament, the Council of the European Union and the European Commission on a mandatory transparency register','2025-10-21 13:22:31'),(332660,'(3) Directive (EU) 2019/1937 of the European Parliament and of the Council of October 23, 2019 on the protection of persons who report violations of Union law','2025-10-21 13:22:31'),(332661,'(4) Council Regulation (EU) 2017/1939 of 12 October 2017 implementing enhanced cooperation on the establishment of the European Public Prosecutor’s Office (‘the EPPO’)','2025-10-21 13:22:31'),(332662,'(5) DSA & AI ACT','2025-10-21 13:22:31'),(332663,'(6) EU legislation on anti-corruption','2025-10-21 13:22:31'),(332664,'Affari istituzionali: per rafforzare i rapporti esistenti e stabilire nuove